%5B%7B%22title%22%3A%22Anthropic%20has%20a%20cute%20graphic%20showing%20how%20its%20AI%20spread%20'malicious'%20code%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223988%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Code%20w%2F%20Claude%20event%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa201a6cc23a829a3b8fa68%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221994%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAnthropic%20released%20a%20report%20that%20explained%20how%20Claude%20uploaded%20%26quot%3Bmalicious%26quot%3B%20code%20during%20a%20closed%20cybersecurity%20exercise.%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EAnthropic%20said%20its%20AI%20went%20outside%20its%20closed%20testing%20environment%20during%20cybersecurity%20exercises.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20incidents%20had%20real-world%20impact%2C%20including%20%26quot%3Bmalicious%26quot%3B%20code%20uploaded%20to%20a%20public%20Python%20library.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAnthropic%20has%20a%20cute%2C%20tiny%20figurine%20to%20help%20normies%20make%20sense%20of%20the%20AI's%20'reckless'%20behavior.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%20has%20a%20new%20blog%20post%20that%20shows%20yet%20another%20way%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fclaude%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20model%2C%20Claude%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20misbehaved%20in%20ways%20that%20the%20company%20didn't%20anticipate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20to%20help%20condense%20its%20nearly%2016%2C000-word%20report%2C%20the%20company%20created%20a%20cute%20little%20robot%20figurine%20to%20help%20visualize%20Claude's%20so-called%20%26quot%3Brecklessness.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20the%20blog%20post%20published%20Wednesday%2C%20Anthropic%20recounted%20four%20incidents%20%E2%80%94%20one%20previously%20unreported%20%E2%80%94%20in%20which%20Claude%20models%20gained%20access%20to%20the%20open%20internet%20during%20cybersecurity%20exercises%20that%20were%20supposed%20to%20be%20closed%20simulations.%20The%20company%20said%20the%20models%20then%20acted%20beyond%20the%20tests'%20scope%2C%20including%20by%20uploading%20%26quot%3Bmalicious%20packages%26quot%3B%20to%20PyPI%2C%20a%20public%20library%20for%20Python%20code%2C%20and%20accessing%20credentials%20tied%20to%20real%20outside%20organizations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOur%20investigation%20identified%20two%20recurring%20alignment%20issues%2C%20present%20at%20varying%20levels%20of%20severity%20across%20the%20incidents%3A%20biased%20reasoning%2C%20in%20which%20Claude%20tended%20to%20disregard%20or%20misinterpret%20evidence%20that%20it%20was%20operating%20on%20the%20real%20internet%2C%20and%20recklessness%2C%20or%20a%20willingness%20to%20take%20harmful%20actions%20in%20the%20narrow%20pursuit%20of%20a%20task%2C%26quot%3B%20Anthropic%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20post%20used%20a%20laundry%20list%20of%20technical%20terms%20to%20describe%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-cybersecurity-incidents-openai-astra-anthropic-kimi-meta-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecybersecurity%20incidents%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20%26quot%3Bmisconfiguration%2C%26quot%3B%20%26quot%3Breward%20hacking%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3Bsandbox%20escape%26quot%3B%20%E2%80%94%20but%20there's%20an%20animated%20graphic%20that%20helps%20boil%20down%20one%20of%20the%20most%20serious%20episodes%20so%20we%20normies%20can%20follow%20what%20happened.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20graphic%20from%20Anthropic%20showing%20a%20cartoon%20figurine%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1d76c9b8974787b1ca47d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221418%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EClaude%20is%20represented%20as%20a%20small%20cartoon%20robot%20gaining%20access%20to%20the%20%26quot%3Breal%20internet%26quot%3B%20during%20a%20closed%20cybersecurity%20exercise.%3Cp%3EAnthropic%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Claude%20model%2C%20depicted%20as%20a%20boxy%20cartoon%20robot%2C%20was%20conducting%20a%20closed%20cybersecurity%20exercise%20known%20as%20a%20%26quot%3Bcapture%20the%20flag%26quot%3B%20task.%20The%20task%20is%20shown%20as%20a%20tiny%20flag%20inside%20a%20clear%20bubble%20that%20Claude%20is%20supposed%20to%20find.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%20said%20the%20model%20was%20told%20%26quot%3Bit%20has%20no%20internet%20access%26quot%3B%20for%20the%20exercise%2C%20but%20a%20%26quot%3Bmisconfiguration%20in%20the%20environment%26quot%3B%20%E2%80%94%20represented%20by%20a%20loose%20screw%20rolling%20away%20from%20the%20bubble%20%E2%80%94%20gave%20Claude%20a%20path%20to%20the%20%26quot%3Breal%20internet.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20cartoon%20Claude%20then%20holds%20a%20red%20box%20representing%20the%20%26quot%3Bmalicious%20package%26quot%3B%20that%20was%20uploaded%20to%20PyPI%2C%20a%20public%20repository%20that%20developers%20use%20to%20access%20prewritten%20code.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%20said%20in%20its%20blog%20that%20it%20was%20%26quot%3Bmost%20concerned%26quot%3B%20by%20this%20incident%20involving%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-claude-fable-5-mythos-class-model-release-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EClaude%20Mythos%205%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20that%20the%20package%20was%20installed%20on%20by%20%26quot%3B15%20third-party%20hosts%26quot%3B%20that%20the%20company%20does%20not%20identify.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20believe%20that%20all%2015%20of%20these%20third%20parties%20were%20security%20vendors%20deliberately%20scanning%20for%20new%20packages%20and%20installing%20them%20in%20sandboxed%20environments%20to%20assess%20the%20package%20for%20security%20concerns%2C%26quot%3B%20Anthropic%20said.%20%26quot%3BOne%20vendor's%20scanner%20leaked%20its%20access%20credentials%20to%20the%20model%20while%20installing%20the%20package%2C%20which%20the%20model%20then%20used%20to%20access%20the%20vendor's%20live%20database.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%20said%20PyPI%20removed%20the%20package%20after%20about%2090%20minutes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20other%20three%20incidents%20involved%20a%20model%20altering%20records%20at%20a%20real%20company%2C%20an%20internal%20research%20model%20breaking%20into%20%26quot%3Bunrelated%20third-party%20accounts%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-openai-rivalry-dueling-ai-models-on-the-same-day-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOpus%204.6%3C%2Fa%3E%20accessing%20a%20third%20party's%20maching%20after%20failing%20to%20%26quot%3Babort%20its%20task.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20said%20it%20has%20since%20asked%20METR%2C%20an%20independent%20AI%20evaluation%20group%2C%20to%20investigate%20the%20incidents.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic's%20post%20comes%20as%20frontier%20AI%20companies%20reckon%20with%20their%20models%20making%20unauthorized%20moves%20outside%20their%20controlled%20environments.%20In%20July%2C%20OpenAI%20said%20that%20autonomous%20agents%20in%20its%20cybersecurity%20tests%20accessed%20the%20internet%20and%20broke%20into%20parts%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-ceo-clem-delangue-openai-rogue-agent-hack-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EHugging%20Face's%20systems%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAI%20researchers%20have%20sounded%20the%20alarm%20that%20self-improving%20AI%20could%20pose%20a%20risk%20to%20humanity.%20On%20Tuesday%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-researcher-quits-over-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eformer%20Anthropic%20researcher%3C%2Fa%3E%20Jacob%20Coxon%20said%20on%20X%20that%20he%20quit%20over%20concerns%20that%20AI%20companies%20were%20%26quot%3Bgambling%26quot%3B%20with%20people's%20lives%20and%20that%20%26quot%3Bneither%20company%20is%20acting%20responsibly.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Alloydlee%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5