says%20no%20audio%20is%20recorded%20or%20stored.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%26quot%3BSiri%20Recap%26quot%3B%20listens%20to%20your%20day%20and%20recaps%20your%20meetings%20and%20conversations.%20Apple%20Watch%20users%2C%20get%20ready%20for%20some%20odd%20looks!%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20you%20got%20an%20Apple%20Watch%20to%20track%20your%20steps%20and%20heart%20rate.%20Now%20all%20your%20friends%20are%20afraid%20you're%20taking%20notes%20on%20their%20conversations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20latest%20Series%2012%20Apple%20Watch%20model%2C%20announced%20at%20the%20company's%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-ultra-event-today-live-updates-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebig%20September%20event%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20includes%20new%20AI%20listening%20features.%20Apple%20is%20calling%20them%20%26quot%3BAudio%20Intelligence.%26quot%3B%20They're%20convenient%20and%20cool%2C%20but%20also%20a%20little%20%E2%80%A6%20weird.%20They%20also%20strike%20me%20as%20very%20un-Appley.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20two%20features%20that%20caught%20my%20eye%20are%20called%20Siri%20Recap%20and%20Live%20Rewind.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESiri%20Recap%20can%20be%20set%20to%20always%20listen%2C%20or%20just%20for%20certain%20hours%20of%20the%20day%20(or%20not%20at%20all).%20The%20AI%20recaps%20are%20available%20upon%20request%20in%20Siri%2C%20and%20will%20be%20a%20recap%20of%20what%20the%20mic%20on%20your%20Apple%20Watch%20heard%20%E2%80%94%20not%20the%20full%20audio%20clip%20or%20transcript.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221834%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Apple's%20new%20Audio%20Intelligence%20Recaps%20feature%20for%20Apple%20Watch%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1ca21ec15fe2d3cf157f6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221394%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple's%20example%20of%20Siri%20Recap%20is%20it%20listening%20and%20taking%20notes%20during%20your%20morning%20personal%20trainer%20session.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20examples%20Apple%20gives%20for%20what%20you%20could%20use%20this%20for%20include%20remembering%20high-level%20moments%20from%20a%20team%20meeting%20or%20a%20parent-teacher%20conference.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELive%20Rewind%20gives%20you%20a%20transcription%20of%20what%20was%20just%20said%20in%20the%20last%2015%20seconds.%20You%20can%20then%20send%20the%20transcription%20to%20Siri%20to%20save%20for%20later.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20the%20example%20they%20give%2C%20a%20server%20speeds%20through%20the%20daily%20menu%20specials%20%E2%80%94%20relatable!%20That's%20always%20a%20challenge%20to%20remember.%20A%20quick%20double-tap%20to%20the%20watch's%20crown%2C%20and%20you%20can%20see%20the%20list%20of%20menu%20items%20she%20just%20rattled%20off.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222940%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Apple's%20Rewind%20Audio%20Intelligence%20feature%20on%20the%20new%20Apple%20Watch%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1caa39b8974787b1ca420%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221644%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple's%20Live%20Rewind%20Audio%20Intelligence%20feature%20on%20the%20new%20Apple%20Watch%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20other%20examples%20they%20give%20for%20using%20this%20are%20remembering%20book%20recommendations%20from%20a%20friend%20or%20a%20great%20idea%20your%20colleague%20just%20had.%20You%20can%20send%20the%20transcript%20to%20Siri%20to%20look%20at%20later%20when%20you%20want%20to%20remember%20that%20book%20or%20great%20idea.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EConvenient!%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cacc71e9-4a72-4064-b559-c301ba172737%5C%22%3EA%20world%20where%20our%20watches%20are%20listening%20feels%20weird%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20in%20both%20cases%2C%20I'm%20not%20sure%20the%20convenience%20fully%20offsets%20how%20%3Cem%3Estrange%3C%2Fem%3E%20I%20would%20feel%20knowing%20I'm%20walking%20around%20with%20an%20always-on%20listening%20device.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETechnically%2C%20it's%20%3Cem%3Eambiently%3C%2Fem%3E%20on%2C%20and%20there%20are%20some%20general%20privacy%20functions.%20Apple%20emphasizes%20that%20audio%20is%20not%20recorded%20or%20stored%2C%20and%20raw%20audio%20isn't%20accessible%20to%20you%20or%20even%20Apple.%20It%20doesn't%20label%20individual%20speakers'%20voices%20to%20identify%20them.%20The%20recap%20summaries%20are%20stored%20in%20Siri%20with%20end-to-end%20encryption.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20even%20so%2C%20something%20here%20feels%20%E2%80%A6%20off.%20It%20means%20if%20I'm%20talking%20to%20you%20and%20you're%20wearing%20an%20Apple%20Watch%2C%20you%20might%20be%20getting%20a%20recap%20of%20our%20conversation%20sent%20to%20Siri%20to%20look%20through%20later.%20That%20feels%20weird!%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20is%20far%20from%20the%20first%20to%20test%20our%20appetites%20for%20AI%20listening%20features.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftech-memo-granola-ai-notetaking-app-review-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20note-taking%20apps%20and%20devices%3C%2Fa%3E%20like%20Plaud%20or%20Granola%20have%20become%20popular%20in%20the%20workplace%20to%20help%20you%20remember%20what%20was%20said%20in%20a%20meeting.%20Great!%20That%20limited%20use%20case%20for%20work-related%20audio%20seems%20useful.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.granola.ai%2Fblog%2Fgranola-for-apple-watch%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGranola%20even%20has%20an%20Apple%20Watch%20app%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20it%20turns%20the%20screen%20bright%20green%2C%20which%20is%20a%20decent%20indication%20for%20others%20in%20the%20room%20that%20someone%20is%20using%20it.%20(Live%20Rewind%20makes%20a%20chiming%20noise%20along%20with%20a%20%26quot%3Bfull-display%20animation%20and%20microphone%20indicator%26quot%3B%20to%20alert%20other%20people%20that%20you%20just%20turned%20it%20on%2C%20but%20Siri%20Recap%20doesn't.)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223cdc0291-247a-436b-b11b-566c3ebbf5d0%5C%22%3EApple%20Watches%20are%20everywhere%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228656%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20Apple%20Watch%20at%20the%20gym%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1ce26cc23a829a3b8f9cb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225776%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAn%20Apple%20Watch%20at%20the%20gym%3Cp%3EMatteo%20Della%20Torre%2FNurPhoto%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EPeople%20wear%20their%20Apple%20Watches%20all%20day%2C%20every%20day%2C%20and%20a%20lot%20more%20people%20have%20Apple%20Watches%20than%20Plaud%20devices.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20wear%20their%20Apple%20Watches%20on%20dates%2C%20at%20the%20doctors'%20offices%2C%20in%20dark%20bars%20and%20school%20classrooms%2C%20while%20having%20sex%20(gotta%20get%20those%20steps%20in)%2C%20sitting%20next%20to%20you%20on%20the%20subway%2C%20gossiping%20with%20friends%2C%20complaining%20about%20their%20boss%20with%20colleagues%2C%20arguing%20with%20their%20spouse%2C%20doing%20drugs%2C%20discussing%20trade%20secrets%2C%20or%20yelling%20at%20their%20kids%20to%20finish%20their%20homework.%20Look%2C%20I%20don't%20know%20what%20you%20do%20with%20your%20time%2C%20and%20I%20don't%20want%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYes%2C%20you%20can%20turn%20this%20off.%20Yes%2C%20someone%20could%20already%20be%20recording%20you%20on%20their%20phone%20at%20any%20time.%20Yes%2C%20these%20note-taking%20recap%20apps%2Fdevices%20already%20exist.%20Yes%2C%20it%20doesn't%20store%20raw%20audio%20recordings%20of%20you%2C%20and%20yes%2C%20it%20has%20some%20privacy%20features%20like%20end-to-end%20encryption.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20there%20is%20something%20very%20different%20about%20all%20this.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20Watches%20are%20everywhere%20%E2%80%94%20I%20am%20wearing%20one%20right%20now%2C%20so%20are%20several%20people%20in%20my%20office%2C%20and%20plenty%20of%20my%20friends%20and%20family.%20I%20don't%20feel%20like%20an%20eavesdropper%20wearing%20an%20Apple%20Watch.%20Unstylish%2C%20maybe%2C%20but%20not%20creepy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20all%20might%20change%