0Duo%20foldable%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20its%20most%20anticipated%20announcement%2C%20Apple%20launched%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-duo-foldable-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Enew%20foldable%20iPhone%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20its%20first%20foray%20into%20foldable%20technology.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20iPhone%20Duo%20starts%20out%20as%20a%205.4-inch%20phone%20with%20a%20screen%2C%20and%20once%20opened%20up%20like%20a%20book%2C%20it%20becomes%20a%207.6-inch%20device%20that%20resembles%20an%20iPad.%20The%20device%20starts%20at%20%241%2C999.%20Pre-orders%20begin%20October%2016%2C%20with%20availability%20beginning%20October%2023.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeet-apple-ceo-john-ternus-replacing-tim-cook-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%3Cu%3EJohn%20Ternus%2C%20Apple's%20CEO%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20said%20during%20the%20launch%20that%20other%20foldables%20feel%20too%20much%20%26quot%3Blike%20two%20phones%20awkwardly%20stuck%20together.%26quot%3B%20The%20company%20instead%20wanted%20a%20larger%20display%2C%20one%20that%20Ternus%20said%20feels%20%26quot%3Bas%20natural%20and%20intuitive%20as%20an%20iPad.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESamsung%2C%20which%20first%20launched%20a%20foldable%20phone%20in%202019%2C%20shared%20its%20thoughts%20on%20Apple's%20shiny%20new%20product%20in%20a%20post%20on%20X.%20%26quot%3BLet%20us%20know%20when%20you're%20done%20reheating%20our%20leftovers%2C%26quot%3B%20it%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EiPhone%2018%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222858%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20iPhone%2018%20Pro.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1b8d3ec15fe2d3cf1574c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221624%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAn%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20in%20Burgundy.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EApple's%20%3Ca%