0and%20the%20Apple%20Watch%20Ultra%204%2C%20the%20latter%20geared%20more%20for%20athletic%20wear.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBoth%20models%20come%20equipped%20with%20%26quot%3Bthe%20most%20accurate%20heart%20rate%20sensing%20in%20a%20wearable%2C%26quot%3B%20Apple%20said.%20Each%20device%20measures%20a%20user's%20heart%20rate%20every%20five%20seconds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20said%20other%20metrics%2C%20like%20heart%20rate%20variability%2C%20are%20also%20measured%20more%20accurately.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BRecovery%20HRV%20is%20best%20for%20identifying%20daily%20signals%20of%20stress%20and%20recovery%2C%20while%20overall%20HRV%20is%20best%20for%20insights%20into%20a%20user's%20broader%20health%2C%20including%20cardiovascular%20health%2C%26quot%3B%20Apple%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAirPods%205%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221918%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20AirPods%205%20user%20sits%20at%20a%20table%20at%20a%20busy%20cafe.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bdb0cc23a829a3b8f910%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221068%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20AirPods%205.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EApple's%20fifth-generation%20AirPods%20are%20getting%20a%20Pro-style%20upgrade%3A%20higher-quality%20active%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftim-cook-warren-buffett-ceo-executive-chair-apple-berkshire-succession-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Enoise%20cancellation%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAirPods%205%2C%20which%20start%20at%20%24129%2C%20can%20block%20up%20to%2050%25%20more%20external%20noise%20than%20the%20prior%20noise-canceling%20model%2C%20the%20company%20said.%20They%20also%20add%20hands-free%20Siri%20AI%20and%20live%20translation.%20A%20%24149%20version%20adds%20a%20wireless%20charging%20case%2C%20longer%20battery%20life%2C%20and%20on-stem%20volume%20sliders.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20launch%20on%20September%2018%20with%20preorders%20now%20available.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EHow%20old%20are%20you%E2%80%A6%20really%3F%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222856%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20opened%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20on%20the%20Health%20App%20screen.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1be4dec15fe2d3cf1576e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221574%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple's%20new%20Health%20Age%20functions.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EApple's%20new%20Watch-based%20monitor%20is%20meant%20to%20answer%20that%20question%20with%20a%20new%20feature%20coming%20to%20the%20Health%20app%2C%20called%20Health%20Age.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESumbul%20Ahmad%20Desai%2C%20the%20company's%20vice%20president%20of%20health%20and%20fitness%2C%20said%20it's%20a%20%26quot%3Bsimple%20way%20to%20discover%20how%20key%20health%20metrics%20align%20with%20your%20actual%20age.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20feature%20uses%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-apple-watch%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20Watch%20data%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20show%20how%20certain%20health%20metrics%20%E2%80%94%20like%20sleep%20patterns%20and%20blood%20composition%20%E2%80%94%20track%20against%20a%20user's%20actual%20age.%20It's%20part%20of%20Apple's%20broader%20push%20to%20turn%20the%20Watch%20from%20a%20step%20counter%20into%20a%20more%20persistent%20health%20companion.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ESiri%20AI%20release%20date%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20iPhone%20with%20the%20Siri%20bubble%20active.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bc289b8974787b1ca38d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAn%20iPhone%20with%20the%20Siri%20bubble%20active.%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ESiri%20AI%2C%20the%20revamped%20assistant%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-wwdc-ios-27-announcements-iphone-photos-parental-controls-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20announced%20in%20June%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20starts%20rolling%20out%20in%20beta%20on%20September%2014%2C%20initially%20in%20English.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20says%20it%20draws%20on%20a%20user's%20personal%20context%20and%20answers%20broader%20questions.%20For%20example%2C%20it's%20now%20capable%20of%20finding%20a%20dinner%20reservation%20buried%20in%20an%20email%20or%20remembering%20a%20song%20a%20friend%20recommended%20in%20a%20text.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20will%20work%20on%20Apple%20Watches%20dating%20back%20to%20the%202023%20Series%209%20when%20paired%20with%20a%20compatible%20iPhone.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAlways%20listening%E2%80%A6%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222816%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20Apple%20Watch%20with%20a%20push%20alert%20notifying%20the%20user%20about%20a%20nearby%20doorbell.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bf1cec15fe2d3cf15788%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221570%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple%20Watch%20will%20help%20users%20listen%20more%20closely.%20That%20opens%20some%20thorny%20privacy%20questions.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20is%20turning%20the%20Apple%20Watch%20into%20an%20AI-powered%20set%20of%20ears.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20coming%20Audio%20Intelligence%20suite%20uses%20the%20Watch's%20microphone%2C%20the%20S11%20chip%2C%20and%20Apple%20Intelligence%20models%20on%20a%20paired%20iPhone%20to%20help%20users%20catch%20sounds%20and%20conversations%20they%20might%20otherwise%20miss.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20says%20it%20will%20help%20hard-of-hearing%20users%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Ftech%2Fbest-apple-watch%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eidentify%20nearby%20alerts%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20transcribe%20conversations%20up%20to%2015%20seconds%20back%2C%20identify%20songs%20playing%20from%20a%20nearby%20speaker%2C%20or%20script%20notes%20from%20an%20important%20meeting.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BApple%20Watch%20is%20always%20on%20your%20wrist%2C%26quot%3B%20Ron%20Huang%2C%20Apple's%20vice%20president%20of%20sensing%20and%20connectivity%2C%20said.%20%26quot%3BIt's%20the%20perfect%20device%20to%20stay%20aware%20of%20the%20sounds%20around%20you%2C%20and%20keep%20track%20of%20your%20conversations.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20says%20the%20features%20do%20not%20create%20or%20store%20audio%20recordings%20and%20that%20they%20do%20not%20identify%20speakers.%20Still%2C%20the%20rollout%20comes%20right%20as%20consumer%20tech%20companies%20face%20increasingly%20thorny%20questions%20about%20AI%2C%20privacy%2C%20and%20surveillance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EiPhone%2018%20will%20have%20an%20improved%20camera%20with%20variable%20aperture%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222740%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Apple%20event%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1973c9b8974787b1ca0ef%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221546%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple's%20fall%202026%20event%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20cameras%20in%20both%20versions%20of%20the%20iPhone%2018%20have%20variable-aperture%20blades%20that%20automatically%20adjust%20to%20different%20lighting%20conditions.%20Adjustments%20in%20aperture%20change%20the%20amount%20of%20light%20that%20reaches%20a%20camera's%20lens.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20said%20its%20new%20aperture%20system%20uses%20%26quot%3Bsix%20laser-cut%20blades%2C%20each%20thinner%20than%20a%20human%20hair.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe've%20optimized%20for%20the%20best%20balance%20of%20light%20gathering%20and%20depth%20of%20field%2C%20and%20the%20aperture%20can%20narrow%20for%20more%20depth%20of%20field%2C%20which%20means%20crisper%20detail%20further%20back%20in%20the%20scene%20for%20better%20group%20shots%2C%26quot%3B%20Kaiann%20Drance%2C%20Apple's%20vice%20president%20of%20worldwide%20Apple%20Watch%20product%20marketing%2C%20said%20during%20the%20launch.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-announcement-recap-foldable-iphone-duo-watch-airpods-siri-ai-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788989933000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1c036cc23a829a3b8f944%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-announcement-recap-foldable-iphone-duo-watch-airpods-siri-ai-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Apple's%20new%20CEO%2C%20John%20Ternus%2C%20unveiled%20the%20next%20generation%20of%20iPhones%2C%20Apple%20Watches%2C%20and%20AirPods%20during%20Wednesday's%20Surprise%20and%20Shine%20event.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22tdickerson%40businessinsider.com%20(Truman%20Dickerson%2CBen%20Shimkus)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22US%20Spy%20Chief%20Preparing%20For%20Bigger%20Role%20In%20Russia%2C%20Ukraine%20Talks%3A%20Reports%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22US%20CIA%20Director%20John%20Ratcliffe%20is%20preparing%20to%20take%20a%20bigger%20role%20in%20Washington's%20negotiations%20with%20Russia%20and%20Ukraine%2C%20US%20officials%20told%20their%20European%20counterparts%2C%20the%20Financial%20Times%20reported%20on%20Wednesday.%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788989646000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fc.ndtvimg.com%2F2026-09%2Fiqqagd5g_john-ratcliffe_625x300_10_September_26.jpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fus-spy-chief-preparing-for-bigger-role-in-russia-ukraine-talks-reports-12025646%23publisher%3Dnewsstand%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22US%20CIA%20Director%20John%20Ratcliffe%20is%20preparing%20to%20take%20a%20bigger%20role%20in%20Washington's%20negotiations%20with%20Russia%20and%20Ukraine%2C%20US%20officials%20told%20their%20European%20counterparts%2C%20the%20Financial%20Tim