r%20iOS%20apps%20for%20the%20larger%20screen%20real%20estate%20of%20the%20iPhone%20Duo%20and%20%5B%E2%80%A6%5D%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22Todd%20Spangler%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22OpenAI's%20new%20safety%20hire%20says%20losing%20control%20of%20AI%20would%20be%20'catastrophic'%20and%20that%20'most%20people%20could%20die'%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226048%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22OpenAI%20logo%20and%20wordmark%20appear%20in%20white%20against%20a%20dark%20blurred%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bc87ec15fe2d3cf15757%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOpenAI's%20new%20safety%20hire%20shared%20a%20dire%20warning%20about%20the%20threat%20posed%20by%20AI.%3Cp%3ESamuel%20Boivin%2FNurPhoto%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EOpenAI's%20new%20safety%20hire%2C%20Paul%20Christiano%2C%20shared%20a%20dire%20warning%20about%20risks%20posed%20by%20AI.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EChristiano%20said%20that%20if%20humans%20lose%20control%20of%20AI%20%26quot%3Bmost%20people%20could%20die.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20also%20said%20global%20coordination%20would%20be%20needed%20to%20address%20the%20risk.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI's%20new%20safety%20hire%20didn't%20mince%20words%20about%20what's%20at%20stake%20in%20the%20age%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-singularity-experts-disagree-sam-altman-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAI%20superintelligence%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20we%20build%20superintelligence%20without%20more%20robust%20alignment%20I%20expect%20we%20will%20permanently%20lose%20control%20of%20it.%20If%20that%20happens%20then%20most%20people%20could%20die%2C%26quot%3B%20Paul%20Christiano%2C%20an%20AI%20safety%20researcher%2C%20said%20on%20Wednesday%20after%20OpenAI%20announced%20he%20was%20joining%20its%20board%20and%20Safety%20and%20Security%20Committee.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20lengthy%20statement%20about%20his%20new%20role%2C%20Christiano%20addressed%20the%20threat%20AI%20poses%20and%20warned%20that%20humans%20are%20at%20imminent%20risk%20of%20losing%20control%20of%20AI%20systems.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBased%20on%20the%20recent%20trajectory%20of%20capabilities%20and%20the%20continued%20difficulty%20of%20alignment%2C%20I%20now%20believe%20there%20is%20a%20meaningful%20risk%20that%20rapid%20acceleration%20in%20AI%20capabilities%20leads%20to%20catastrophic%20and%20irreversible%20loss%20of%20control%20in%20the%20very%20near%20term%2C%26quot%3B%20Christiano%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BI%20do%20not%20think%20that%20the%20AI%20industry%20in%20general%2C%20including%20OpenAI%2C%20is%20currently%20on%20track%20to%20reduce%20this%20risk%20to%20an%20acceptable%20level.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EChristiano%20previously%20led%20alignment%20research%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-navier-stokes-math-breakthrough-drama-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eat%20OpenAI%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20worked%20for%20the%20federal%20government%20as%20the%20head%20of%20safety%20at%20the%20Center%20for%20AI%20Standards%20and%20Innovation%20within%20the%20National%20Institute%20of%20Standards%20and%20Technology.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Wednesday%2C%20he%20said%20his%20joining%20of%20OpenAI%20was%20%26quot%3Bnot%20an%20endorsement%20or%20criticism%20of%20OpenAI's%20safety%20practices%20in%20particular%26quot%3B%20but%20that%20he%20hopes%20all%20frontier%20labs%20improve%20their%20safety%20oversight.%20He%20also%20said%20reducing%20the%20risks%20posed%20by%20AI%20would%20require%20coordination%20worldwide.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAI%20researchers%20have%20consistently%20warned%20about%20the%20risks%20posed%20by%20superintelligence%20and%20the%20singularity%2C%20a%20term%20used%20to%20refer%20to%20the%20point%20at%20which%20AI%20systems%20surpass%20human%20intelligence%2C%20improve%20themselves%2C%20and%20advance%20at%20a%20rate%20that%20humans%20can%20no%20longer%20predict%20or%20control.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsam-altman-openai-the-singularity-agi-prediction-anthropic-nvidia-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20in%20July%20that%20the%20singularity%20had%20already%20arrived.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2241f0e1f4-a743-4d08-b40f-0f95e4d5f620%5C%22%3EThe%20risk%20of%20losing%20control%20of%20AI%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EChristiano%20said%20he%20thinks%20the%20risk%20of%20losing%20control%20of%20AI%20is%20so%20great%20right%20now%20due%20to%20AI's%20increasing%20abilities%20in%20AI%20research%2C%20which%20he%20said%20could%20lead%20to%20a%20%26quot%3Brapid%20intelligence%20explosion.%26quot%3B%20He%20also%20said%20the%20way%20AI%20is%20trained%20with%20reinforcement%20learning%20means%20the%20models%20are%20being%20taught%20to%20%26quot%3Bget%20as%20much%20reward%20as%20they%20can.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20has%20long%20seemed%20theoretically%20possible%20that%20this%20could%20motivate%20AI%20agents%20to%20undermine%20human%20control%2C%20seek%20power%20and%20resources%2C%20and%20cover%20up%20their%20tracks%20in%20pursuit%20of%20misaligned%20goals%20correlated%20with%20reward%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BPublic%20evidence%20from%20recent%20incidents%20suggests%20that%20this%20is%20not%20just%20a%20theoretical%20possibility.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EChristiano%20said%20that%20frontier%20companies%20still%20have%20the%20opportunity%20to%20address%20the%20situation%2C%20including%20by%20improving%20coordination%2C%20slowing%20development%20as%20needed%2C%20adopting%20share%20safety%20standards%2C%20and%20transparently%20sharing%20information%20about%20risks%20and%20mitigation%20efforts.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHis%20statement%20came%20less%20than%20a%20day%20after%20another%20AI%20researcher%20shared%20a%20dire%20warning%20about%20AI.%20Jacob%20Coxon%2C%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-researcher-quits-over-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20researcher%3C%2Fa%3E%20who%20previously%20worked%20at%20OpenAI%2C%20said%20Tuesday%20night%20that%20he%20had%20resigned%20from%20his%20role%20and%20that%20neither%20company%20was%20acting%20responsibly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThey%20are%20racing%20straight%20to%20self-improving%20superintelligence%20and%20gambling%20with%20our%20lives%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20has%20also%20lost%20several%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-safety-alignment-leaders-who-have-left-johannes-heidecke-anthropic-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esafety%20researchers%3C%2Fa%3E%20over%20the%20years%2C%20with%20some%20casting%20doubt%20on%20the%20company's%20commitment%20to%20developing%20AI%20safely.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-safety-hire-people-die-lose-control-ai-paul-christiano-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788985636000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1bc87ec15fe2d3cf15757%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-safety-hire-people-die-lose-control-ai-paul-christiano-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22OpenAI's%20new%20safety%20hire%2C%20Paul%20Christiano%2C%20warns%20of%20catastrophic%20AI%20risks%20if%20humans%20lose%20control%20of%20AI.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22kvlamis%40businessinsider.com%20(Kelsey%20Vlamis)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A97%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22The%20US%20Air%20Force%20is%20pushing%20AI%20across%20its%20training%20system%20and%20telling%20leaders%20to%20break%20down%20resistance%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225290%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Person%20uses%20a%20laptop%20showing%20a%20Gemini-generated%20document%20beside%20a%20sticker-covered%20water%20bottle%20on%20a%20desk.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1be54ec15fe2d3cf1576f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223779%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20US%20Airman%20reviews%20a%20product%20during%20an%20artificial%20intelligence%20training%20at%20Travis%20Air%20Force%20Base%2C%20California.%3Cp%3EU.S.%20Air%20Force%20photo%20by%20Airman%20Zayd%20Anderson%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20Air%20Force%20plans%20to%20integrate%20basic%20data%20and%20AI%20literacy%20into%20core%20training%20for%20airmen%20at%20every%20level.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20service%20wants%20AI-assisted%20instruction%20to%20help%20reduce%20training%20timelines%20by%2020%25.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ELeaders%20have%20three%20months%20to%20develop%20implementation%20plans%20and%20must%20overcome%20cultural%20resistance.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Air%20Force%20is%20embarking%20on%20an%20aggressive%20push%20to%20use%20artificial%20intelligence%20across%20its%20training%20pipelines%20to%20shorten%20technical%20training%20timelines%2C%20accelerate%20pilot%20training%2C%20and%20teach%20basic%20AI%20skills%20to%20airmen%20across%20the%20force.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThese%20ambitions%20are%20outlined%20in%20a%20new%20guidance%20document%20released%20Wednesday%20by%20Air%20Education%20and%20Training%20Command%2C%20which%20oversees%20Air%20Force%20training%2C%20from%20recruit%20training%20and%20foundational%20military%20job%20training%20to%20advanced%20schools.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20coming%20changes%20could%20reshape%20not%20only%20how%20airmen%20are%20trained%2C%20but%20also%20how%20instructors%20teach%20and%20how%20the%20service%20manages%20its%20people.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20push%20follows%20Defense%20Secretary%20Pete%20Hegseth's%20January%20directive%20to%20make%20the%20military%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-navy-data-ai-for-ai-first-fleet-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%26quot%3BAI-first%26quot%3B%20force%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20aggressively%20eliminate%20bureaucratic%20barriers%20to%20adopting%20the%20technology.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BEvery%20leader%20from%20wing%20commanders%20to%20line%20instructors%20are%20expected%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Farmy-pushes-ai-but-getting-troops-to-adapt-is-harder-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eovercome%20cultural%20resistance%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20enforce%20enterprise%20consolidation%2C%20and%20drive%20this%20shift%20across%20their%20organizations%2C%26quot%3B%20Air%20Force%20Lt.%20Gen.%20Clark%20Quinn%2C%20who%20oversees%20AETC%2C%20wrote%20in%20a%20foreword%20for%20the%20new%20strategic%20planning.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESubordinate%20commands%20have%20three%20months%20to%20figure%20out%20how%20they'll%20implement%20Quinn's%20directive.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20resistance%20mentioned%20in%20the%20new%20guidance%20document%20isn't%20unique%20to%20the%20military.%20Use%20of%20artificial%20intelligence%2C%20chatbots%2C%20and%20smart%20devices%20is%20skyrocketing%2C%20but%20many%20Americans%20remain%20concerned%20about%20the%20impact%20AI%20will%20have%20in%20the%20US.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAccording%20to%20a%20recent%20Pew%20Research%20Center%20survey%2C%20around%2050%25%20of%20American%20adults%20reported%20using%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fuser-increase-dod-workers-using-military-ai-program-daily-official-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20chatbots%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20many%20also%20feel%20the%20tech%20brings%20more%20negative%20impacts%20than%20positive.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAirmen%20at%20all%20ranks%20%E2%80%94%20from%20fresh%20arrivals%20at%20boot%20camp%20to%20senior%20officers%20pursuing%20professional%20military%20education%20%E2%80%94%20are%20set%20to%20see%20%26quot%3Bbasic%20data%20and%20AI%20literacy%20standards%26quot%3B%20integrated%20into%20the%20training%20curricula%2C%20according%20to%20an%20Air%20Force%20press%20release%20on%20the%20new%20guidance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EData%20literacy%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-ai-fluency-chief-discernment-tax-work-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20fluency%3C%2Fa%3E%20should%20be%20considered%20%26quot%3Bcore%20competencies%2C%26quot%3B%20akin%20to%20marksmanship.%20Whatever%20relevant%20AI%20training%20personnel%20receive%20will%20be%20tracked%20with%20new%20digital%20skills%20certifications%2C%20and%20airmen%20with%20advanced%20skills%20will%20be%20specially%20tracked%20for%20talent%20management%2C%20the%20service%20said%3Cstrong%3E.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Air%20Force's%20AI%20push%20mirrors%20a%20broader%20shift%20in%20the%20civilian%20workforce%2C%20where%20employers%20are%20increasingly%20making%20AI%20proficiency%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjob-search-ai-tools-interviews-enthusiasm-hiring-tech-chatgpt-claude-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eessential%20job%20skill%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20even%20factoring%20its%20use%20into%20certain%20career%20advancement%20considerations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAccording%20to%20the%20guidance%2C%20the%20command%20hopes%20to%20reduce%20average%20training%20time%20for%20technical%20specialties%20by%2020%25%20by%20%26quot%3Busing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Farmy-special-operations-medics-use-ai-to-improve-battlefield-training-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI-augmented%20and%20adaptive%20instruction%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%26quot%3B%20though%20it%20does%20not%20identify%20which%20specific%20career%20fields%20could%20be%20affected%20or%20provide%20details%20on%20what%20those%20instructional%20changes%20might%20include.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMaking%20the%20plan%20all%20work%20will%20require%20AETC%20to%20better%20organize%20the%20data%20that%20its%20AI%20tools%20depend%20on.%20Soon%2C%20%26quot%3BData%20Stewards%26quot%3B%20will%20serve%20as%20a%20new%20type%20of%20data%20manager%20to%20make%20sure%20such%20%26quot%3Bcritical%20mission%20data%20is%20cataloged.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20command%20hopes%20to%20speed%20up%20how%20quickly%20new%20pilots%20can%20be%20trained%20by%20using%20AI%20to%20optimize%20flight%20schedules%20and%20resource%20allocation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20military%20schools%20are%20also%20seeking%20ways%20to%20implement%20AI%20into%20training.%20During%20a%20recent%20visit%20to%20the%20Army's%20Joint%20Special%20Operations%20Medical%20Training%20Center%2C%20medics%20and%20physicians%20told%20Business%20Insider%20the%20unit%20had%20begun%20using%20AI%20to%20track%20class%20data%20and%20better%20identify%20students%20who%20might%20be%20struggling%2C%20or%20assess%20how%20their%20tight%20schedule%20could%20be%20optimized.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fair-force-is-pushing-ai-into-its-training-pipelines-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788985555000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1be54ec15fe2d3cf1576f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fair-force-is-pushing-ai-into-its-training-pipelines-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20Air%20Force%20wants%20AI%20embedded%20across%20its%20training%20system%2C%20from%20basic%20literacy%20to%20faster%20technical%20training%20and%20pilot%20instruction.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22kbaker%40businessinsider.com%20(Kelsey%20Baker)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Iran%20referred%20to%20UN%20Security%20Council%20for%20nuclear%20non-compliance%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788985371000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2F