s-midterm-votes-12025426%23publisher%3Dnewsstand%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-ndtv-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fdonald-trump-says-iran-war-will-end-immediately-after-us-midterm-votes-12025426%2Famp%2F1%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fdonald-trump-says-iran-war-will-end-immediately-after-us-midterm-votes-12025426%2Famp%2F1%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22The%20US%20Army's%20special%20drone%20unit%20is%20returning%20to%20airborne%20infantry%20work.%20Officials%20say%20that%20was%20always%20the%20plan.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227008%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20small%20black%20quadcopter%20drone%20is%20seen%20flying%20in%20the%20sky%20above%20trees.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1a6839b8974787b1ca2b2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224672%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20decision%20to%20phase%20out%20the%20battalion's%20experimental%20drone%20role%20sparked%20questions%20about%20how%20the%20Army%20intends%20to%20pursue%20drone%20warfare%20and%20lessons%20from%20Ukraine.%3Cp%3EUS%20Army%20photo%20by%201st%20Lt.%20Brandon%20Miles%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EUS%20Army%20officials%20said%20the%20drone%20experimentation%20role%20of%20one%20of%20its%20battalions%20was%20always%20meant%20to%20be%20temporary.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20decision%20to%20phase%20out%20the%20drone%20focus%20confused%20experts%20and%20lawmakers%20alike.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20Army's%20priority%20is%20to%20democratize%20drone%20warfare%20lessons%20and%20tactics%20across%20formations.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20US%20Army%20says%20that%20its%20special%20battalion%20focused%20on%20drone%20warfare%20and%20lessons%20from%20Ukraine%20was%20always%20meant%20to%20be%20a%20temporary%20experiment%2C%20not%20a%20lasting%20element%20of%20the%20force.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-has-lost-top-figures-driving-transformation-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EUnmanned%20Assault%20Battalion%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20created%20last%20fall%20as%20an%20experimental%20unit%20in%20the%20173rd%20Airborne%20Brigade%20specializing%20in%20drone%20tactics.%20The%203rd%20Battalion%20of%20the%20504th%20Parachute%20Infantry%20Regiment%20was%20tasked%20with%20testing%20uncrewed%20systems%20and%20developing%20battlefield%20lessons%20the%20Army%20could%20apply%20more%20broadly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20news%20broke%20last%20month%20that%20the%20service%20intended%20to%20phase%20out%20the%20battalion's%20drone-focused%20mission%20and%20return%20it%20to%20airborne%20infantry%2C%20with%20a%20focus%20on%20traditional%20warfighting%2C%20the%20move%20prompted%20questions%20about%20why%20the%20Army%20was%20ending%20the%20experiment%20and%20concerns%20about%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-soldiers-stormed-desert-city-war-prep-drones-new-tech-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ewider%20approach%20to%20drone%20warfare%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20an%20Army%20modernization%20media%20roundtable%20on%20Wednesday%2C%20Army%20officials%20said%20that%20the%20shift%20had%20been%20planned%20from%20the%20beginning%20and%20presented%20how%20they%20intend%20to%20spread%20lessons%20on%20uncrewed%20aerial%20systems%20across%20the%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThey%20were%20never%20flagged%20to%20be%20a%20permanent%20centralized%20drone%20unit%2C%26quot%3B%20Alex%20Miller%2C%20the%20Army's%20chief%20technology%20officer%2C%20told%20reporters.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIn%20fact%2C%20we%20pushed%20back%20on%20having%20something%20like%20a%20drone%20corps%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Esince%20its%20inception%20because%20our%20theory%20of%20the%20case%20is%2C%20if%20you%20centralize%20that%20in%20one%20place%2C%20what%20you%20lose%20is%20the%20ability%20to%20actually%20scale%20that%20learning%20and%20send%20that%20out%20to%20the%20rest%20of%20the%20Army%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20plan%2C%20Miller%20said%2C%20was%20for%20the%20battalion%20to%20test%20uncrewed%20technologies%20and%20learn%20tactics%20in%20the%20six%20to%20seven%20months%20before%20they%20received%20their%20full%20infantry%20battalion%20equipment.%20Then%2C%20the%20Army%20would%20disseminate%20those%20takeaways%20across%20the%20service%20and%20the%20troops%20from%20the%20battalion%20would%20return%20to%20their%20role%20as%20airborne%20infantry.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20The%20Wall%20Street%20Journal%20first%20reported%20the%20change%2C%20an%20Army%20spokesperson%20said%20the%20service%20was%20committed%20to%20%26quot%3Bdrone%20dominance%26quot%3B%20but%20did%20not%20comment%20on%20future%20plans.%20The%20Journal%20reported%20that%20no%20end%20date%20was%20specified%20when%20the%20battalion's%20drone%20role%20was%20established.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20time%2C%20an%20Army%20spokesperson%20told%20Business%20Insider%20the%20unit's%20findings%20would%20inform%20force%20design%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-mastering-drone-warfare-doesnt-mean-always-right-weapon-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efuture%20experimentation%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20reporting%20on%20the%20plans%20to%20phase%20out%20the%20battalion's%20drone%20mission%20raised%20concerns%20among%20defense%20analysts%20and%20lawmakers%2C%20who%20questioned%20what%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ethe%20decision%20signaled%20about%20the%20Army's%20commitment%20to%20drone%20warfare%2C%20the%20service's%20willingness%20to%20learn%20from%20Ukraine's%20warfighting%20experiences%2C%20and%20broader%20Pentagon%20priorities%20for%20uncrewed%20capabilities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20have%20deep%20concerns%20that%20eliminating%20this%20specialized%20drone%20unit%20will%20limit%20our%20ability%20to%20learn%20from%20allies%2C%20particularly%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-borrowing-from-ukraines-diy-drone-warfare-strategy-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EUkrainian%20Armed%20Forces%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20hinder%20our%20efforts%20to%20modernize%20drone%20warfare%20at%20the%20speed%20necessary%20to%20compete%20on%20the%20modern%20battlefield%2C%26quot%3B%20US%20lawmakers%20wrote%20in%20a%20recent%20letter%20to%20Army%20leadership.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20US%20Army%20soldier%20fires%20a%20rifle%20while%20standing%20next%20to%20a%20white%20wall.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1a6f7cc23a829a3b8f82a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225464%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAfter%20the%20conclusion%20of%20Exercise%20Saber%20Junction%2C%20the%20battalion%20will%20refocus%20on%20its%20core%20warfighting%20tactics.%3Cp%3EUS%20Army%20photo%20by%20Spc.%20Jordan%20Leroy%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20letter%20added%20that%20%26quot%3Bthis%20specialized%20unit%20was%20a%20prudent%20response%20in%20a%20moment%20when%20the%20character%20of%20warfare%20is%20changing%20faster%20than%20a%20conventional%20formation's%20ability%20to%20adapt.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Army%20didn't%20explain%20publicly%20that%20the%20drone%20mission%20was%20always%20intended%20as%20a%20short-term%20experiment%20when%20the%20planned%20change%20first%20drew%20criticism%20weeks%20ago%2C%20but%20officials%20said%20Wednesday%20they%20wanted%20to%20clarify.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe're%20sort%20of%20combating%20this%20narrative%20that%20we%20set%20something%20new%20up%2C%20and%20then%20we%20killed%20that%20new%20thing%2C%20and%20we're%20going%20to%20sacrifice%20it%20at%20the%20altar%20of%20technology%2C%26quot%3B%20Miller%20said.%20%26quot%3BThat's%20just%20not%20true.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20argued%20that%20spreading%20lessons%20across%20the%20Army%20rather%20than%20concentrating%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-soldiers-working-out-how-to-use-drones-punishing-conditions-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edrone%20expertise%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20a%20permanent%20unit%20better%20fits%20the%20goal%20of%20making%20uncrewed%20systems%20a%20routine%20part%20of%20how%20the%20larger%20force%20fights.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhen%20we%20engage%20with%20the%20Ukrainians%20and%20we%20engage%20with%20their%20leadership%2C%20it%20was%20less%20a%20drone%20corps%20and%20was%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Emore%20of%20one%20platoon%20per%20company%2C%20one%20company%20per%20battalion%2C%20which%20looked%20an%20awful%20lot%20like%20how%20we%20were%20actually%20setting%20up%20our%20tactical%20UAS%20platoons%20as%20a%20formation%20anyway%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Army%20rejected%20the%20idea%20that%20ending%20the%20battalion's%20drone-focused%20mission%20represents%20a%20step%20backward%20in%20its%20efforts%20to%20integrate%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-fiber-optic-drones-ambush-tactics-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Euncrewed%20capabilities%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20are%20not%20slowing%20down%20on%20drones%20or%20autonomous%20systems%2C%20and%20we%20are%20not%20walking%20away%20from%20them%2C%26quot%3B%20Miller%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20officials%2C%20likewise%2C%20said%20that%20drone%20capabilities%20are%20continuing%20to%20spread%20across%20formations%20regardless.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20are%20employing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwestern-spy-drones-journey-from-factory-to-ukraine-war-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eunmanned%20aircraft%20systems%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20all%20levels%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Brent%20Ingraham%2C%20the%20assistant%20secretary%20of%20the%20Army%20for%20acquisitions%2C%20logistics%2C%20and%20technology%2C%20adding%20that%20%26quot%3Bwhile%20there%20was%20an%20experimental%20drone%20battalion%2C%20we%20are%20scaling%20that%20capability%20across%20the%20entire%20Army.%26quot%3B%3