20has%20been%20in%20talks%20to%20acquire%20AI%20startup%20Listen%20Labs%20for%20around%20%242%20billion.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EListen%20Labs%2C%20which%20was%20last%20valued%20at%20%24500%20million%2C%20sells%20an%20AI%20market%20analysis%20platform.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ERecent%20AI%20M%26amp%3BA%20deals%20include%20Nvidia's%20%2412.9%20billion%20acquisition%20of%20AI%20startup%20Hugging%20Face.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ESalesforce%20could%20be%20on%20the%20hunt%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsalesforce-takeover-targets-after-slack-acquisition-growth-2022-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eacquisitions%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20beef%20up%20its%20AI%20capabilities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20software%20giant%20has%20recently%20been%20in%20talks%20to%20buy%20Listen%20Labs%2C%20an%20AI-powered%20customer%20research%20platform%20for%20around%20%242%20billion%2C%20according%20to%20people%20familiar%20with%20the%20matter.%20The%20talks%20have%20not%20been%20finalized%20and%20could%20ultimately%20be%20unsuccessful%2C%20according%20to%20a%20person%20with%20knowledge%20of%20the%20deal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESalesforce%20and%20Listen%20Labs%20did%20not%20respond%20to%20requests%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EListen%20Labs%20was%20founded%20in%202023%20by%20Alfred%20Wahlforss%20and%20Florian%20Juengermann%2C%20who%20first%20met%20as%20undergraduates%20at%20Harvard%20University%20while%20building%20an%20AI%20avatar%20app%20that%20went%20viral%2C%20attracting%2020%2C000%20users%20on%20its%20first%20day%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fsequoiacap.com%2Farticle%2Fpartnering-with-listen-labs-next-level-customer-obsession%3Futm_source%3Dchatgpt.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eaccording%20to%20Sequoia%20Capital.%3C%2Fa%3E%20Juengermann%20was%20previously%20a%20national%20champion%20in%20competitive%20programming%20in%20Germany.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20used%20an%20early%20version%20of%20what%20would%20become%20Listen%20Labs%20to%20interview%20users%2C%20which%20helped%20them%20realize%20that%20using%20AI%20for%20market%20research%20would%20be%20extremely%20valuable.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company's%20software%20automates%20much%20of%20the%20qualitative%20research%20process%2C%20which%20has%20typically%20been%20expensive%20and%20time-consuming.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECustomers%20include%20Microsoft%2C%20Anthropic%2C%20Google%2C%20Nestle%2C%20Sweetgreen%2C%20and%20Perplexity.%20At%20the%20beginning%20of%20the%20year%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Flistenlabs.com%2Fblog%2Fannouncing-listen-s-series-b%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EListen%20Labs%20said%20it%20had%20grown%20its%20annualized%20revenue%20by%2015x%20and%20interviewed%20more%20than%20one%20million%20people%20in%20nine%20months.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20Salesforce%2C%20the%20deal%20would%20strengthen%20its%20broader%20quest%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finside-salesforce-struggles-agentforce-flagship-ai-agent-wars-benioff-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eto%20make%20its%20agentic%20AI%20platform%2C%20Agentforce%2C%20more%20than%20just%20about%20automating%20repetitive%20work.%20%3C%2Fa%3EListen%20Labs%20could%20boost%20Agentforce%20by%20understanding%20what%20customers%20are%20thinking.%20It%20could%20recommend%20which%20products%20they%20might%20buy%20and%20craft%20the%20perfect%20pitch%20for%20salespeople%20to%20close%20a%20deal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20the%20deal%20were%20finalized%2C%20it%20would%20be%20part%20of%20a%20wave%20of%20AI%20acquisitions%20in%20recent%20weeks%2C%20with%20Nvidia%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnvidia-in-talks-to-buy-hugging-face-13-billion-dollars-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eacquiring%20HuggingFace%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20around%20%2412.9%20billion%20and%20Stripe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnvidia-in-talks-to-buy-hugging-face-13-billion-dollars-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebuying%20OpenRouter%3C%2Fa