th%20a%20partner%20who%20has%20different%20preferences%2C%20they%20will%20need%20a%20separate%20BedJet%203%20unit%20for%20their%20side%20of%20the%20bed%2C%20which%20will%20run%20on%20their%20programmed%20plan.%20We%20found%20that%20this%20clash%20was%20a%20bit%20off-putting%20at%20times%2C%20like%20cold%20and%20warm%20fronts%20colliding.%20Given%20that%20this%20is%20your%20sleep%20space%2C%20and%20not%20The%20Weather%20Channel%2C%20we%20recommend%20the%20Bed%20Jet%20for%20couples%20staying%20in%20tune%20about%20temperature%20fluctuations%20on%20each%20side%20or%20solo%20sleepers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22side%20by%20side%20of%20the%20bed%20jet%20and%20a%20person%20under%20the%20sheet%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa188d39b8974787b1c9fee%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22900%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Bedjet%20sits%20at%20the%20base%20of%20your%20bed%20and%20pumps%20cool%20or%20warm%20air%20via%20a%20fan%20across%20the%20bed's%20surface.%20We%20recommend%20using%20the%20percale%20Cloud%20Sheet%2C%20which%20inflates%20around%20you%20for%20a%20cooling%20effect.%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Crozier%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20appeal%20of%20this%20system%20isn%E2%80%99t%20just%20cooling%20on%20a%20budget%2C%20but%20the%20flexibility%20to%20use%20it%20with%20any%20bed%20setup%2C%20regardless%20of%20mattress%20or%20frame.%20The%20brand%20recommends%20using%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D85233104f0f4ea335f41f29737606bec9f256e7eb11687b2ffe2cf54df3c7b32%26postID%3D6aa06ecbcf0c79be48cf099a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-bed-cooling-systems%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fbedjet.com%252Fproducts%252Faircomforter%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECloud%20Sheet%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20contain%20the%20fan%20opening%2C%20as%20your%20bedding%20will%20puff%20up%20a%20bit