20design%20takes%20a%20different%20approach%20from%20the%20competition%20to%20enhance%20comfort%20and%20temperature-control%20effectiveness%20%E2%80%94%20Hydrocool%20thermoplastic%20layers%20instead%20of%20internal%20tubing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221620%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22a%20look%20at%20the%20layers%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a10c59f51ede568c7e17d54%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221080%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Chilipad%202.0%20features%20a%20tubeless%20Hydrocool%20layer%20that%20distributes%20even%20temperature%20control%20across%20the%20bed's%20surface.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EChilipad%E2%80%99s%20use%20of%20Hydrocool%20chambers%20over%20internal%20tubes%20is%20very%20intentional.%20It%E2%80%99s%20designed%20to%20provide%20better%20temperature%20control%20while%20feeling%20less%20obtrusive.%20During%20testing%2C%20we%20used%20a%20temperature%20gun%20at%20different%20points%20on%20the%20bed%20to%20assess%20the%20effectiveness%20of%20thermal%20regulation%2C%20and%20the%20Chilipad%202.0%20showed%20it%20was%20pumping%20water%20across%20a%20greater%20surface%20area%20of%20the%20mattress%20on%20both%20sides%20of%20the%20bed%E2%80%94unlike%20other%20toppers%20that%20centralize%20cooling%20directly%20beneath%20their%20internal%20tubes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20there%20are%20no%20rigid%20tubes%20poking%20through%20the%20foam%20encasement%2C%20active%20sleepers%20won't%20feel%20wayward%20coils%20or%20lines%20beneath%20them.%20Instead%2C%20the%20internal%20Hydrocool%20layer%20lends%20a%20slightly%20stiffer%2C%20tarp-like%20feel%20to%20lie%20on%3B%20while%20unobtrusive%2C%20it%20may%20take%20a%20few%20nights%20to%20get%20used%20to.%20Sizing%20flexibility%20is%20another%20major%20draw%2C%20with%20both%20one-%20and%20two-sleeper%20options%20available.%20Two-sleeper%20models%20give%20each%20partner%20independent%20control%2C%20while%20single-sided%20models%20let%20you%20cool%20your%20half%20of%20the%20mattress%20while%20leaving%20your%20partner's%20side%20untouched.%20For%20dual%20users%2C%20it%E2%80%99s%20priced%20similarly%20to%20the%20Eight%20Sleep%20but%20offers%20significant%20savings%20if%20you%20only%20need%20a%20single-sided%20setup.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221620%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22dock%20under%20a%20bed%20frame%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a10c87c7ff506e273e66fad%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221080%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EUnlike%20other%20docking%20stations%20that%20must%20be%20placed%20at%20the%20foot%20of%20the%20bed%2C%20I%20was%20able%20to%20slide%20it%20under%20the%20head%20of%20my%20bed.%20It%20still%20needs%20to%20be%20easily%20accessible%20for%20maintenance%20and%20water%20refills.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EKeep%20in%20mind%20that%20dual-sleeper%20setups%20require%20a%20bedside%20dock%20on%20each%20side%2C%20and%20both%20emit%20a%20faint%20operational%20hum%2C%20but%20they%20can%20easily%20tuck%20away%20out%20of%20sight%20under%20the%20bed.%20I%20found%20myself%20having%20to%20refill%20the%20dock%20almost%20every%20night%20with%20distilled%20water%2C%20though.%20While%20the%20Chilipad%20lacks%20sleep%20tracking%20or%20automatic%20temperature%20adjustments%20based%20on%20your%20sleep%20quality%2C%20it%20includes%20a%20bedside%20remote%20that%20also%20serves%20as%20a%20charging%20station%2C%20along%20with%20a%20companion%20app%20for%20customizable%20nightly%20schedules%2C%20in%20which%20the%20topper%20will%20heat%20and%20cool%20according%20to%20your%20temperature%20preferences.%20Whether%20you%20want%20the%20bed%20icy%20cold%20when%20you%20slide%20under%20the%20covers%2C%20need%20programmed%20temperature%20shifts%20to%20prevent%20waking%20up%20overheated%20at%20midnight%2C%20or%20want%20a%20blast%20of%20cold%20air%20to%20act%20as%20a%20morning%20alarm%2C%20these%20options%20are%20available%20to%20you.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERead%20our%20full%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fchilipad-cooling-mattress-topper-review%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EChilipad%202.0%20review%20%3C%2Fa%3Efor%20more%20details.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EGet%20this%20if%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20You%20sleep%20with%20a%20partner%20and%20want%20to%20minimize%20disruptions%20from%20temperature%20imbalances%2C%20or%20if%20you%20want%20a%20tubeless%20cooling%20system%20without%20a%20subscription.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkip%20this%20if%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20You%20require%20sleep%20tracking%20with%20your%20cooling%20system.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2283ce55bd-29ee-4141-93d7-00f14eba6e3b%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20for%20sleep%20tracking%5C%22%3EBest%20for%20sleep%20tracking%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EArguably%2C%20the%20vast%20majority%20of%20sleepers%20who%20turn%20to%20cooling%20systems%20are%20doing%20so%20because%20they%20are%20at%20wits%E2%80%99%20end%20with%20night%20sweats.%20But%20this%20isn%E2%80%99t%20the%20only%20target%20market%20for%20cooling%20systems%3A%20couples%2C%20athletes%2C%20those%20who%20use%20sleep-tracking%20metrics%20to%20monitor%20their%20health%2C%20and%20even%20biohackers%20looking%20to%20optimize%20their%20sleep%20are%20also%20interested.%20That%E2%80%99s%20where%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D99481afa72536e4e3b9bb15c5ebd1e9ac54d0d4d38fc3bd8f2f0ce7c041dd0f7%26postID%3D6aa06ecbcf0c79be48cf099a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fhome%252Fbest-bed-cooling-systems%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fgo.skimresources.com%252F%253Fid%253D35871X943606%2526amp%253Burl%253Dhttps%25253A%25252F%25252Forionsleep.com%25252Fproducts%25252Forion-sleep-system%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EOrion%20Sleep%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%99s%20data%20tracking%20and%20presentation%20stood%20out.%20It%E2%80%99s%20very%20similar%20to%20Eight%20Sleep%20%E2%80%94%20but%20costs%20%24450%20less.%20Technically%2C%20a%20subscription%20isn%E2%80%99t%20required%2C%20but%20the%20annual%20fee%20lets%20you%20access%20your%20sleep%20data%20and%20provides%20recommendations%20for%20how%20to%20sleep%20better.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221620%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22orion%20sleep%20system%20in%20a%20bedroom%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1741dec15fe2d3cf15245%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221080%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Orion%20Sleep%20uses%20AI%20to%20regulate%20temperature%20throughout%20the%20night%20to%20help%20you%20stay%20asleep.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20first%20step%20of%20this%20smart%20topper%20involves%20a%20sleep%20test%20to%20calibrate%20your%20sleep%20system%3A%20wear%20a%20%E2%80%9CSleep%20Disruption%26quot%3B%20patch%20to%20bed%2C%20and%20that%20initial%20data%20will%20inform%20the%20preliminary%20setup%20of%20your%20Orion%20Sleep%20system.%20You%20can%20forgo%20this%20step%2C%20as%20it%E2%80%99s%20an%20additional%20%2425%20fee%20and%20requires%20meeting%20with%20an%20Orion%20Sleep%20expert%2C%20but%20it%E2%80%99s%20a%20launch%20point%20for%20those%20who%20are%20serious%20about%20capturing%20accurate%20data%20points.%20In%20terms%20of%20setup%2C%20Orion%20is%20similar%20to%20Eight%20Sleep%20in%20that%20it%20uses%20a%20bedside%20docking%20station%20outfitted%20with%20tubes%20that%20pump%20water%20into%20the%20foam%20topper.%20The%20dock%20is%20also%20taller%20than%20Eight%20Sleep%2C%20making%20it%20a%20little%20harder%20to%20conceal%2C%20but%20it%20has%20an%20aesthetically%20pleasing%20appearance.%20I%20experienced%20some%20technical%20difficulties%20during%20setup%2C%20but%20the%20Orion%20team%20was%20very%20quick%20to%20respond%20in%20the%20app%20and%20run%20diagnostics%20to%20pinpoint%20the%20issue.%20In%20total%2C%20the%20process%20took%20about%20two%20hours%2C%20but%20it%20typically%20takes%20about%2045%20minutes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOrion%20AI%20will%20track%20your%20sleep%20patterns%20to%20make%20temperature%20adjustments%20based%20on%20the%20body%20temperature%20fluctuations%20it%20reads.%20It%E2%80%99ll%20also%20map%20out%20your%20sleep%20duration%20and%20stages%2C%20movement%2C%20breathing%20disturbances%2C%20heart%20rate%2C%20heart%20rate%20variability%2C%20and%20breathing%20rate.%20It%20also%20analyzes%20%E2%80%9Csleep%20debt%E2%80%9D%20based%20on%20these%20factors%2C%20indicating%20how%20much%20sleep%20you%20need%20to%20account%20for%20in%20your%20upcoming%20night%E2%80%99s%20sleep%2C%20or%20whether%20you%20are%20on%20track.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221200%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22orion%20screenshot%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1741dec15fe2d3cf15244%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22900%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Orion%20app%20provides%20rich%20insights%20into%20your%20sleep%2C%20sleep%20duration%20and%20stages%2C%20movement%2C%20breathing%20disturbances%2C%20heart%20rate%2C%20heart%20rate%20variability%2C%20and%20breathing%20rate.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20breadth%20and%20depth%20of%20data%20are%20helpful%20and%20available%20via%20Orion%20Intelligence.%20It%20starts%20off%20as%20a%2060-day%20trial%2C%20and%20then%20it%20is%20an%20annual%20%24250%20a%20year%20fee.%20Automatic%20temperature%20fluctuations%20are%20helpful%2C%20but%20aren%E2%80%99t%20perfect%20off%20the%20bat%2C%20as%20the%20system%20needs%20time%20to%20record%20data.%20Initially%2C%20it%20didn%E2%80%99t%20feel%20as%20cool%20as%20it%20could%20have%20been%2C%20especially%20when%20manual%20cooling%20adjustments%20were%20made%20in%20the%20app.%20Additionally%2C%20Orion%E2%80%99s%20design%20is%20sleek%2C%20but%20not%20foolproof.%20You%20can%20feel%20water%20movement%20beneath%20you%2C%20usually%20by%20an%20onset%20of%20cooling%20or%20heating%2C%20detect%20some%20soft%20light%20emitted%20by%20the%20machine%2C%20and%20hear%20the%20soft%20hum%20of%20the%20machine%20as%20it%20runs.%20None%20of%20it%20is%20strongly%20interfering%20with%20your%20sleep%20routine%2C%20but%20if%20you%E2%80%99re%20coming%20from%20an%20absolutely%20silent%20sleep%20space%2C%20it%20does%20take%20getting%20adjusted%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EGet%20this%20if%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20You%E2%80%99re%20looking%20for%20comprehensive%20sleep%20tracking%20and%20data%20breakdowns.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkip%20this%20if%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Low-tech%20systems%20are%20more%20your%20speed%2C%20or%20if%20subscriptions%20aren%E2%80%99t%20in%20budget.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22140bfd0c-aca9-45cc-95a0-6affcf1543ae%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20fan-powered%5C%22%3EBest%20fan-powered%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%E2%80%99re%20ready%20to%20put%20body%20heat%20on%20blast%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fperfectlysnug.com%2Fproducts%2Fthe-smart-topper%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EPerfectly%20Snug%3C%2Fa%3E%20cooling%20system%E2%80%99s%20approach%20is%20very%20different%20from%20those%20listed%20in%20this%20guide.%20It%20reads%20your%20body%20temperature%20and%20makes%2010-degree%20adjustments%2C%20either%20warmer%20or%20cooler%2C%20with%20the%20help%20of%20four%20small%20fans%20situated%20inside%20the%20topper.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223088%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22a%20woman%20adjusting%20the%20perfectly%20snug%20topper%20on%20the%20bed%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1761dec15fe2d3cf15256%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222316%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Perfectly%20Snug%20functions%20more%20like%20a%20memory%20foam%20mattress%20topper%20than%20a%20cover%20that%20clings%20to%20your%20bed.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20topper%20looks%20like%20any%20other%20traditional%20one%20you%E2%80%99d%20put%20atop%20your%20mattress%2C%20and%20comes%20with%20separate%20adjustable%20straps%20should%20you%20need%20them.%20A%20mesh%20cover%20improves%20breathability%20for%20the%20fans%20working%20beneath%20you.%20Sensors%20within%20keep%20track%20of%20your%20body%20temperature%2C%20adjusting%20the%20fans%20to%20run%20to%20warm%20you%20up%20or%20cool%20you%20off%20by%2010%20degrees%20Fahrenheit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20there%20is%20in-app%20control%2C%20there%E2%80%99s%20also%20a%20side%20panel%20that%20lets%20you%20adjust%20in%20real%20time%20instead%20of%20reaching%20for%20your%20phone%20in%20the%20wee%20hours.%20You%E2%80%99ll%20have%20to%20mentally%20note%20the%20placement%2C%20because%20with%20a%20top%20sheet%20covering%20it%2C%20you%20may%20be%20fidgeting%20around%20in%20the%20dark%20to%20find%20it.%20Additionally%2C%20the%20topper%20makes%20a%20slight%20crunch%2C%20like%20plastic%20cellophane%20wrap%2C%20when%20you%20lie%20on%20it%20or%20press%20down%20on%20it%20%E2%80%94%20not%20exactly%20relaxing%2C%20particularly%20if%20you%20have%20sensory%20issues.%20To%20this%20end%2C%20it%E2%80%99s%20also%20important%20to%20note%20that%20the%20fans%20will%20generate%20noise%20that%20increases%20with%20fan%20speed.%20Cooler%20means%20a%20higher%20velocity%2C%20so%20expect%20more%20noise%20in%20these%20instances.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221620%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22the%20cords%20for%20the%20perfectly%20snug%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1761dcc23a829a3b8f3de%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221080%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWhile%20the%20Perfectly%20Snug%20doesn't%20require%20a%20bulky%20base%2C%20the%20cord%20often%20came%20disconnected%20and%20didn't%20sit%20nicely%20with%20our%20headboard.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAnother%20tester%20noted%20that%20the%20cord%20connections%20at%20the%20top%20of%20the%20bed%20come%20unplugged%20if%20you%20toss%20and%20turn%2C%20and%20resorted%20to%20taping%20them%20together%20to%20stay%20in%20place%2C%20which%20isn%E2%80%99t%20ideal.%20If%20your%20bedframe%20does%20not%20have%20enough%20space%20for%20the%20cords%20to%20drape%20discreetly%20behind%20the%20bed%2C%20you%E2%80%99re%20forced%20to%20jam%20them%20against%20the%20wall%20or%20headboard%20%E2%80%94%20which%20we%20found%20out%20the%20hard%20way%2C%20and%20could%20be%20considered%20a%20fire%20hazard.%20She%20also%20found%20the%20app%20rather%20basic%20and%20had%20issues%20keeping%20the%20WiFi%20connection%2C%20so%20she%20turned%20to%20the%20topper%E2%80%99s%20manual%20adjustments%20via%20buttons%20on%20the%20side%20of%20the%20topper%20instead%20of%20the%20app.%20You%20can%20also%20turn%20off%20the%20companion%20voice%20within%20the%20app%2C%20which%20announces%20on%20each%20side%20when%20the%20system%20is%20turned%20on%20and%20off%2C%20which%20we%20found%20a%20bit%20jarring.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Caside%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EGet%20this%20if%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20You%E2%80%99re%20looking%20for%20automatic%20sleep%20temperature%20adjustments%2C%20but%20without%20water%20usage.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkip%20this%20if%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20Any%20sort%20of%20noise%20keeps%20you%20up%20at%20night.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3C%2Faside%3E%5Cn%3Chr%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226ba8335b-ecc4-48ce-96d9-1ea984c976a2%5C%22%3EThe%20Competition%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fvip.ghostbed.com%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGhostBed%20Climate%20Pro%3C%2Fa%3E%3A%20This%20system%20hasn%E2%80%99t%20yet%20hit%20the%20market%2C%20but%20it%20promises%20to%20offer%20sleep%20tracking%20without%20subscription%20fees.%20The%20design%20follows%20a%20dual-zone%2C%20water-based%20construction%20that%20can%20be%20controlled%20via%20app%20or%20the%20dock.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D33b6f7785543c839d5b2daa93494b2e153a635a2120cbcda674f90f2e138ce56%26po