2C%20formally%20known%20as%20%E2%80%9Cactive%20cooling%2C%E2%80%9D%20can%20be%20categorized%20into%20two%20groups%3A%20air-based%20and%20water-based%20cooling%20systems.%20As%20natural%20thermoregulators%2C%20they%20can%20pick%20up%20heat%20and%20circulate%20it%20away%20from%20the%20body%20for%20regulation%20by%20an%20underbed%20or%20bedside%20pump.%20From%20there%2C%20the%20temperature-conditioned%20air%20or%20water%20is%20pumped%20back%20out%20via%20internal%20tubes%20or%20chambers%20or%20delivered%20atop%20the%20mattress%20surface.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20systems%20below%20can%20detect%20body%20temperature%20fluctuations%20and%20adjust%20the%20surface%20temperature%20accordingly%20to%20keep%20you%20comfortable%20and%2C%20more%20importantly%2C%20asleep.%20Others%20will%20maintain%20a%20stagnant%20temperature%20of%20your%20choosing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d47f7e8b-3a83-402c-babd-f403dd9cc1af%5C%22%3EWater-based%20systems%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EProducts%20in%20this%20group%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESleepme%20Chilipad%202.0%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Euses%20two%20thermoplastic%20Hydrolayers%20to%20circulate%20water%20and%20regulate%20temperature.%20It%20also%20has%20a%20cool-to-the-touch%20cover%20to%20heighten%20this%20effect.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EEight%20Sleep%20Pod%205%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20features%20a%20bedside%20docking%20system%20and%20a%20thin%20foam%20topper%20with%20tubes.%20Water%20is%20pumped%20into%20these%20tubes%2C%20and%20with%20the%20Pod%205%E2%80%99s%20smart%20programming%2C%20can%20automatically%20adjust%20to%20your%20body%20temperature%20fluctuations%20while%20asleep.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOrion%20Sleep%20System%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eis%20another%20tube-based%2C%20water-reliant%20system%20that%20has%20smart%20features.%20It%20can%20also%20adjust%20temperature%20while%20asleep%20and%20track%20sleep%20metrics.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d298bd60-138b-44cd-8091-5458a5f37374%5C%22%3EAir-based%20systems%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EProducts%20in%20this%20group%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBedJet%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eblows%20air%20between%20the%20sheets%2C%20ideally%20through%20its%20Cloud%20Sheet.%20It%20changes%20the%20microclimate%20under%20the%20covers%20rather%20than%20chilling%20the%20mattress%20itself.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPerfectly%20Snug%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eintegrates%20fans%20and%20sensors%20inside%20a%20two-inch%20topper%2C%20so%20it%20cools%20from%20beneath%20the%20sleeper%20without%20an%20external%20hub%20or%20hose.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a1775564-b849-4321-a8ee-c9420b9c692a%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Who%20cooling%20systems%20are%20best%20for%5C%22%3EWho%20cooling%20systems%20are%20best%20for%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ENight%20sweats%20can%20be%20caused%20by%20a%20variety%20of%20factors%2C%20like%20perimenopause%2C%20menopause%2C%20aging%2C%20body%20composition%2C%20medications%2C%20or%20simply%20living%20in%20a%20warmer%20climate.%20If%20you%20know%20these%20are%20the%20drivers%20behind%20your%20recurring%20night%20sweats%2C%20a%20cooling%20system%20may%20help%20tremendously%20%E2%80%94%20and%20can%20offer%20targeted%2C%20dual-zone%20relief%20for%20you%20and%20a%20partner.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20medical%20experts%20warn%20against%20using%20technology%20to%20mask%20potential%20health%20issues.%20%26quot%3BYour%20body%20is%20telling%20you%20something%E2%80%94you%20want%20to%20avoid%20masking%20symptoms%20without%20addressing%20the%20root%20issue%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fchoc.org%2Fmedical-staff%2Fpulmonology%2Fjohn-saito-md%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDr.%20John%20Saito%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20spokesperson%20for%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faasm.org%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAmerican%20Academy%20of%20Sleep%20Medicine%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDr.%20Saito%20notes%20that%20anyone%20experiencing%20sudden%20or%20severe%20night%20sweats%20without%20an%20obvious%20cause%20should%20consult%20a%20doctor%20first.%20Crucially%2C%20individuals%20with%20underlying%20neurological%20or%20vascular%20conditions%20should%20exercise%20caution%20before%20buying.%20Because%20these%20conditions%20impair%20the%20body's%20natural%20temperature%20regulation%E2%80%94like%20blood%20vessel%20dilation%20and%20sweating%E2%80%94using%20an%20active%20cooling%20pad%20can%20make%20it%20difficult%20to%20sense%20extreme%20temperatures%2C%20posing%20a%20risk%20of%20severe%20overheating%20or%20chilling.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2254f0bf8c-e83f-48a6-86e3-0bddcf2e0d56%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22What%20to%20look%20for%5C%22%3EWhat%20to%20look%20for%20in%20a%20bed%20cooling%20system%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221620%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22a%20woman%20lies%20on%20a%20mattress%20topper%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa17987cc23a829a3b8f431%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221080%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMost%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20offer%20heating%20and%20cooling%2C%20but%20consider%20the%20cooling%20method%2C%20whether%20you%20need%20dual%20zone%20support%2C%20desire%20smart%20features%2C%20and%20think%20about%20maintenance.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226f26f6f3-80fb-4bfe-843d-454403e8871a%5C%22%3ECooling%20method%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EBoth%20air-%20and%20water-based%20cooling%20systems%20rely%20on%20active%20cooling%2C%20which%20involves%20ongoing%20temperature%20regulation%20to%20maintain%20a%20controlled%20sleep%20environment.%20However%2C%20how%20they%20do%20so%20function%20differently%3A%20%3Cstrong%3EWater-based%20systems%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Eprovide%20precise%2C%20conductive%20thermal%20control%20across%20the%20entire%20mattress%20surface%20but%20require%20regular%20distilled%20water%20refills%20and%20reservoir%20sanitation.%20%3Cstrong%3EAir-based%20systems%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20use%20forced%20airflow%20or%20internal%20fans%20to%20alter%20the%20microclimate%20under%20your%20duvet%2C%20offering%20a%20low-maintenance%2C%20hose-free%20setup%20at%20the%20expense%20of%20potential%20wind%20noise.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAdditionally%2C%20some%20will%20use%20passive%20cooling%20features%2C%20such%20as%20the%20Chilipad%202.0%2C%20which%20has%20a%20cool-to-the-touch%20cover%20that%20initially%20feels%20colder%20when%20you%20lie%20down.%20As%20you%20settle%20in%2C%20the%20active%20cooling%20mechanisms%20take%20over%20for%20temperature%20control.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d3bbe01e-6ff3-4eaa-80d1-b12151be2f3c%5C%22%3ETemperature%20range%20and%20zone%20controls%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ECooling%20bed%20systems%20will%20market%20generous%20temperature%20ranges%20(50%C2%B0F%20to%20115%C2%B0F)%20as%20a%20draw%20for%20sleepers%20who%20sleep%20too%20warm%20or%20even%20cold.%20Realistically%2C%20the%20temperature%20range%20you%20should%20be%20sleeping%20in%20is%20much%20more%20limited.%20If%20you%20share%20a%20bed%2C%20dual-zone%20coverage%20allows%20each%20sleeper%20to%20adjust%20their%20side%20independently%20without%20thermal%20bleed.%20Some%20brands%2C%20like%20Chilipad%2C%20BedJet%2C%20and%20Perfectly%20Snug%2C%20also%20offer%20single-sided%20coverage.%20This%20allows%20a%20sleeper%20who%20needs%20temperature%20control%20to%20get%20exactly%20what%20they%20need%2C%20while%20their%20partner%20can%20enjoy%20the%20feel%20of%20their%20mattress%2C%20and%20also%20saves%20you%20from%20having%20to%20spend%20on%20a%20feature%20your%20bedmate%20won%E2%80%99t%20use.%20Dual%20Zones%20also%20typically%20require%20separate%20units%20to%20operate%2C%20with%20Eight%20Sleep%20and%20Orion%20being%20the%20exception%2C%20which%20requires%20only%20one%20cooling%20tower%20to%20cover%20both%20sides.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228c0c60ea-8534-4db9-a8cf-68b6f5584081%5C%22%3EMattress%20feel%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ECooling%20systems%20are%20meant%20to%20enhance%20your%20sleep%20experience%20and%20blend%20in%20with%20your%20mattress%20setup%2C%20not%20detract%20from%20it.%20Most%20toppers%20add%201%20to%202%20inches%20of%20high-density%20foam%20to%20your%20bed.%20Orion%20Sleep%20and%20Eight%20Sleep%20encase%20tubes%20in%20thin%20layers%20of%20foam%2C%20which%20is%20generally%20firmer%20to%20prevent%20you%20from%20feeling%20the%20tubing%20while%20still%20allowing%20for%20pressure%20relief.%20Similarly%2C%20Perfectly%20Snug%E2%80%99s%20fans%20utilize%20foam%20to%20protect%20the%20mechanisms%20and%20prevent%20you%20from%20feeling%20them.%20Most%20should%20not%20affect%20the%20mattress%20firmness%2C%20but%20you%20may%20be%20able%20to%20detect%20tubes%20or%20water%20chambers%20beneath%20you.%20However%2C%20this%20is%20a%20worthwhile%20tradeoff%20for%20many%20dealing%20with%20restless%20nights%20due%20to%20overheating.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMost%20cooling%20systems%20can%20serve%20as%20mattress%20protectors%20when%20placed%20atop%20the%20bed.%20In%20the%20case%20of%20the%20BedJet%20system%2C%20because%20fans%20blow%20air%20across%20the%20surface%2C%20there%20is%20no%20barrier%20to%20protect%20your%20bed.%20Therefore%2C%20a%20mattress%20protector%20should%20be%20utilized%20to%20fully%20protect%20your%20mattress.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229a86cf9c-97df-45c9-a3b4-0963a1a8d03c%5C%22%3ESmart%20features%20(and%20ongoing%20subscription%20fees)%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20varying%20levels%20to%20what%20a%20%E2%80%9Csmart%E2%80%9D%20app%20that%20accompanies%20a%20smart%20cooling%20system%20actually%20entails.%20Baseline%20systems%20will%20come%20with%20bedside%20or%20handheld%20remotes%20for%20making%20changes%2C%20along%20with%20a%20basic%20app%20that%20lets%20you%20control%20them%2C%20but%20no%20sleep%20tracking%20or%20scheduling.%20More%20advanced%20smart%20systems%20can%20monitor%20biometrics%2C%20heart%20rate%2C%20and%20body%20temperature%20to%20adjust%20surface%20cooling%20automatically%20throughout%20the%20night%20and%20provide%20sleep%20feedback%20without%20the%20use%20of%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhealth-coach-fitness-wearables-best-for-performance-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewearable%3C%2Fa%3E.%20However%2C%20you%E2%80%99ll%20need%20to%20factor%20in%20ongoing%20ownership%20costs%3A%20platforms%20like%20Eight%20Sleep%20(%24199-%24399%2Fyear)%20and%20Orion%20(%24250%2Fyear)%20lock%20automated%20thermal%20adjustments%20behind%20mandatory%20recurring%20subscriptions%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f83d07c2-8859-47a4-b85f-0a3c9e95b336%5C%22%3ENoise%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EEvery%20smart%20cooling%20system%20you%E2%80%99ll%20come%20across%20makes%20noise%2C%20as%20it%20is%20the%20compromise%20you%20have%20to%20make%20to%20ensure%20consistent%20active%20cooling.%20Luckily%2C%20the%20majority%20of%20systems%20aren%E2%80%99t%20blaring%2C%20like%20a%20fan%20whirring%2C%20a%20white%20noise%20machine%2C%20or%20an%20AC%20unit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22012a8911-209f-4d7d-ada4-096f478fa62f%5C%22%3EMaintenance%20and%20ongoing%20costs%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EConsider%20how%20much%20investment%2C%20both%20upkeep%20and%20ongoing%20costs%2C%20you%20want%20to%20put%20towards%20a%20cooling%20bed%20system.%20More%20advanced%20systems%20require%20subscriptions%20to%20access%20sleep%20data%20and%20premium%20features.%20Water-based%20systems%20typically%20require%20monthly%20internal%20upkeep%20to%20prevent%20bacterial%20or%20mineral%20buildup%2C%20often%20using%20proprietary%20cleaning%20tablets%20or%20solutions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223d02fda8-c86e-4907-afed-0878cccff7be%5C%22%3ETrial%20and%20warranty%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20cooling%20systems%20we%20tried%20typically%20offer%20trial%20periods%20between%2030%20and%2060%20days.%20Warranty%20coverage%20also%20helps%20cover%20against%20defective%20parts%2C%20providing%20replacements%20or%20repairs.%20Two%20years%20is%20the%20standard.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22aa175ca5-62be-4aac-ba0f-df46237c5b2e%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22How%20we%20tested%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow%20we%20tested%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224032%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22a%20girl%20sits%20on%20top%20of%20a%20mattress%20in%20a%20bedroom%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a10c5067ff506e273e66f6f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20spent%20several%20weeks%20sleeping%20on%20each%20cover%20for%20at%20least%20a%20week%2C%20some%20even%20long-term.%3Cp%3EJulia%20Forbes%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20sleep%20testing%20team%20spent%20several%20weeks%20evaluating%20each%20cooling%20system%20in%20real-world%20bedroom%20environments.%20We%20scored%20each%20model%20across%20four%20key%20criteria%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%225073f70a-649d-4a47-8b68-cb43e52b3e08%5C%22%3ESetup%20and%20usability%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20timed%20unboxing%2C%20secure%20mattress%20attachment%2C%20initial%20app%20pairing%2C%20and%20Wi-Fi%20setup.%20For%20instance%2C%20I%20liked%20that%20Orion%20Sleep%20and%20Chilipad%202.0%20have%20product-specific%20labels%20to%20denote%20each%20step%20of%20the%20process%2C%20along%20with%20written%20and%20video%20tutorials%20to%20follow%20along.%20Orion%20Sleep%20took%20two%20hours%20due%20to%20a%20technical%20difficulty%3B%20Chilipad%202.0%20took%20an%20hour%20to%20set%20up%20both%20docks%20and%20the%20sides%20of%20the%20bed%3B%20and%20Perfectly%20Snug%20took%20less%20than%2020%20minutes%2C%20including%20downloading%20the%20app.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22bbb2fb16-85e7-450e-aac7-b9f35d3b4b89%5C%22%3ECooling%20performance%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EUsing%20infrared%20temperature%20guns%2C%20we%20verified%20minimum%20cooling%20and%20maximum%20heat%20temperatures%2C%20and%20compared%20t%20our%20sleep%20metrics%20with%20sleep%20wearables%20and%2C%20if%20available%2C%20with%20the%20system%E2%80%99s%20app.%20Based%20on%20sleep%20quality%2C%20time%20asleep%2C%20and%20consistent%20performance%2C%20this%20denoted%20a%20truly%20successful%20cooling%20performance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f3879a1d-6383-41bc-8fc3-77749c4ccb1e%5C%22%3EOvernight%20comfort%20(including%20noise)%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20assessed%20physical%20tactile%20feel%20(how%20well%20internal%20tubes%2C%20fans%2C%20and%20layers%20were%20masked%20beneath%20fitted%20sheets)%20and%20recorded%20operational%20decibel%20levels%2C%20pump%20hums%2C%20and%20dock%20light%20output%20in%20pitch-black%20rooms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20most%2C%20each%20system%20should%20equate%20to%20a%20white%20noise%20machine%20or%20fan%20while%20actively%20running.%20If%20you%20consider%20yourself%20a%20light%20sleeper%20who%20is%20disturbed%20easily%20and%20prefers%20complete%20silence%2C%20you%20may%20have%20to%20opt%20for%20earplugs%20or%20consider%20alternative%20methods%20to%20cooling%20bed%20systems.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b07073a6-51ae-4355-9cab-c85257c186d6%5C%22%3EDual%20zone%20precision%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20dual-sided%20models%2C%20we%20ran%20varied%20temperatures%20on%20each%20side%20to%20test%20zone%20independence%20and%20measure%20heat%20bleed%20across%20the%20center%20seam.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Chr%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2200911ab5-407e-4dce-bbbf-d93d9b09bad9%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22FAQ%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBed%20Cooling%20System%20FAQ%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Ch3%3EDo%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20actually%20work%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EYes%2C%20cooling%20bed%20systems%20actually%20work.%20Cooling%20bed%20systems%20are%20still%20evolving%2C%20but%20the%20options%20available%20now%20may%20be%20invaluable%20for%20those%20seeking%20relief%20from%20nightly%20overheating.%20They%20are%20quieter%2C%20sleeker%2C%20and%20more%20feature-rich%2C%20but%20still%20an%20investment%20in%20your%20sleep.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EHow%20do%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20compare%20to%20cooling%20mattress%20toppers%20and%20smart%20beds%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EConventional%20cooling%20toppers%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20use%20breathable%20or%20cool-to-the-touch%20materials%20but%20do%20not%20actively%20regulate%20temperature.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBed%20cooling%20systems%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20add%20powered%20water%20or%20airflow%20technology%20to%20an%20existing%20mattress.%20They%E2%80%99re%20the%20focus%20of%20this%20guide.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESmart%20mattresses%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20integrate%20technology%20into%20the%20mattress%20itself%20and%20may%20offer%20firmness%20adjustment%2C%20sleep%20tracking%2C%20temperature%20regulation%2C%20or%20some%20combination%20of%20those%20features.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Ch3%3EAre%20water-%20or%20air-based%20systems%20better%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20truly%20depends%20on%20your%20preferences.%20Some%20are%20wary%20of%20potential%20water%20leakage%20from%20water-based%20systems%20and%20prefer%20air-based%20systems%20altogether.%20Others%20may%20prefer%20water-based%20temperature%20regulation%20over%20air%20constantly%20breezing%20across%20the%20surface%20of%20their%20bed%20to%20help%20keep%20them%20dry.%20Either%20way%2C%20expect%20low%20noise%20levels%20from%20cooling%20systems%E2%80%99%20control%20units%20while%20operating.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3ECan%20a%20bed%20cooling%20system%20replace%20air%20conditioning%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EGenerally%2C%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20work%20in%20tandem%20with%20air%20conditioning%20and%20reduce%20how%20hard%20it%20has%20to%20work%20%E2%80%94%20but%20they%20do%20not%20replace%20it%20entirely.%20While%20your%20air%20conditioning%20and%20any%20ceiling%20fans%20regulate%20the%20surrounding%20temperature%20of%20your%20bedroom%2C%20your%20cooling%20system%20is%20dedicated%20solely%20to%20the%20mattress%20surface.%20To%20ensure%20it%E2%80%99s%20not%20straining%20itself%20to%20compensate%20for%20environmental%20temperature%2C%20it%E2%80%99s%20best%20to%20have%20both.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%E2%80%9CThe%20American%20Academy%20of%20Sleep%20Medicine%20recommends%20that%20the%20ideal%20environment%20for%20sleep%20is%20cool%2C%20dark%2C%20quiet%2C%20in%20a%20range%20of%2068%20to%2072%E2%84%89.%20For%20some%2C%20it%20can%20extend%20to%2065%20to%2075%E2%84%89%2C%E2%80%9D%20says%20Dr.%20Saito.%20He%20also%20explains%20that%20even%20with%20AC%20and%20cooling%20systems%2C%20it%E2%80%99s%20important%20for%20people%20to%20manage%20their%20sleep%20%E2%80%9Cmicroenvironment%E2%80%9D%20or%20bed%2C%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fstyle%2Fbest-cooling-pajamas%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecooling%20pajamas%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-sheets%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebedsheets%3C%2Fa%3E%20as%20well%2C%20all%20geared%20toward%20breathability.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EDo%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20help%20with%20night%20sweats%20or%20hot%20flashes%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3ECooling%20systems%20cater%20to%20sleepers%20dealing%20with%20night%20sweats%20and%20hot%20flashes.%20With%20ongoing%2C%20active%20temperature%20regulation%2C%20it%20can%20be%20a%20vital%20tool%20for%20ensuring%20better%20sleep%2C%20keeping%20you%20asleep%2C%20and%20preventing%20temperature-spike%20disruptions.%20The%20physiological%20sensation%20of%20feeling%20a%20cooler%20surface%20can%20help%20with%20sleeping%20in%20these%20instances.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20Dr.%20Saito%20puts%20it%2C%20%E2%80%9CIn%20my%20opinion%2C%20%5Bperceived%20environmental%20temperature%5D%20matters%20because%20it%E2%80%99s%20about%20your%20core%20body%20temperature%20and%20your%20brain%E2%80%99s%20response%20to%20the%20body%20temperature%20change.%20Whether%20it's%20the%20environment%20outside%2C%20in%20your%20room%2C%20in%20the%20bed%2C%20or%20your%20clothing%2C%20it%E2%80%99s%20really%20how%20it%20affects%20you%20individually.%E2%80%9D%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EAre%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20worth%20it%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20are%20someone%20who%20has%20had%20enough%20of%20night%20sweats%2C%20hot%20flashes%2C%20and%20ongoing%20discomfort%20from%20overheating%2C%20cooling%20systems%20may%20be%20the%20very%20thing%20you%E2%80%99ve%20been%20waiting%20for.%20If%20you're%20a%20hot%20sleeper%20but%20not%20to%20the%20point%20of%20recurring%20night%20sweats%2C%20you%20may%20not%20need%20to%20jump%20for%20a%20cooling%20system.%20Instead%2C%20look%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-cooling-mattress%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecooling%20mattresses%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20accessories%20that%20promote%20passive%20cooling%20through%20temperature-regulating%20covers%2C%20as%20well%20as%20materials%20designed%20to%20enhance%20airflow%20and%20prevent%20heat%20retention.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EShould%20I%20buy%20a%20bed%20cooling%20system%20or%20a%20smart%20mattress%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EA%20bed%20cooling%20system%20is%20generally%20the%20more%20practical%20choice%20if%20you%20like%20your%20current%20mattress%20and%20primarily%20want%20temperature%20control.%20A%20smart%20mattress%20may%20make%20more%20sense%20if%20you%E2%80%99re%20already%20replacing%20your%20bed%20and%20want%20features%20like%20adjustable%20firmness%20or%20integrated%20sleep%20tracking.%20Compare%20the%20full%20cost%2C%20subscription%20requirements%2C%20repairability%2C%20trial%20period%2C%20and%20whether%20the%20cooling%20components%20can%20be%20replaced%20independently%20of%20the%20mattress.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EAre%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20HSA%2FFSA%20eligible%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EYes%2C%20all%20of%20the%20cooling%20bed%20systems%20we%20tested%20are%20HSA-%20or%20FSA-eligible%2C%20allowing%20you%20to%20use%20your%20pre-tax%20dollars%20to%20save%20up%20to%2030%25.%20This%20includes%20Eight%20Sleep%2C%20Orion%2C%20Bedjet%2C%20SleepMe%2C%20and%20Perfectly%20Snug.%20Many%20sleep%20products%20are%20HSA-%20or%20FSA-eligible%2C%20but%20they%20do%20require%20a%20letter%20of%20medical%20necessity%2C%20which%20is%20easier%20to%20obtain%20than%20you'd%20expect.%20See%20our%20explainer%20about%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fhow-to-use-fsa-hsa-for-mattress%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehow%20to%20use%20your%20FSA%20or%20HSA%20on%20a%20new%20mattress%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20bedding%2C%20or%20cooling%20system.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f968a81d-e256-4b8d-b72a-6fd9b4067055%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-bed-cooling-systems%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788980401000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa17d79cc23a829a3b8f49d%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fbest-bed-cooling-systems%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22If%20night%20sweats%20keep%20you%20up%2C%20active%20cooling%20can%20help.%20We%20tested%20the%20best%20bed%20cooling%20systems%20that%20deliver%20consistent%2C%20all-night%20temperature%20control.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Julia%20Forbes)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22The%20Best%20Tech%20at%26nbsp%3BIFA%202026%3A%20From%204K%20Projectors%20and%20Wearables%20to%20Headphones%20and%20TV%20Smart%20Lighting%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788980400000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fvariety.com%2F%3Fp%3D1236849068%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22While%20CES%20is%20the%20biggest%20tech%20industry%20showcase%20in%20the%20United%20States%2C%20IFA%20is%20the%20largest%20consumer%20electronics%20trade%20show%20in%20Europe.%20For%20more%20than%20100%20years%2C%20some%20of%20the%20best%20and%20biggest%20communication%20and%20tech%20companies%20from%20around%20the%20world%20have%20gathered%20in%20the%20heart%20of%20Berlin%2C%20Germany%20at%20the%20Messe%20Berlin%20exhibition%20grounds%2C%20%5B%E2%80%A6%5D%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22Rudie%20Obias%22%2C%22engag