ields-are-rising-economic-outlook-inflation-war-japan-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBond%20investors%3C%2Fa%3E%20have%20had%20a%20rough%20few%20years%20since%20the%20start%20of%20the%20COVID-19%20pandemic%2C%20but%20the%20tables%20look%20like%20they're%20about%20to%20turn.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20according%20to%20fixed-income%20giant%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhere-to-invest-right-now-fixed-income-pimco-bond-market-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EPimco%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20oversees%20%242.3%20trillion%20in%20assets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20early%202020%2C%2010-year%20Treasury%20yields%20have%20risen%20from%200.65%25%20to%204.8%25.%20An%20inflation%20flare-up%20in%202021%20and%202022%20fueled%20much%20of%20that%20rise%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-yields-rising-treasury-bonds-inflation-stocks-oil-interest-rates-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eyields%20have%20again%20surged%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20recent%20months%20as%20investors%20worry%20about%20rising%20oil%20prices%20and%20government%20debt%20levels.%20When%20bond%20yields%20rise%2C%20bond%20values%20decrease.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20long-dated%20bonds%20have%20slid%20far%20enough%20now%20that%20the%20assets%20look%20attractive%20specifically%20for%20their%20yields%2C%20Pimco%20multi-asset%20credit%20strategist%20Lotfi%20Karoui%20wrote%20in%20a%20note%20on%20Tuesday.%20That's%20because%20current%20yields%20offer%20attractive%20income%20levels%20to%20offset%20portfolio%20losses%2C%20as%20well%20as%20a%20high%20enough%20starting%20point%20that%20they%20can%20appreciate%20in%20a%20poor%20growth%20environment%2C%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInvestors%20can%20expect%20the%20broader%20bond%20market%20to%20deliver%20anywhere%20from%204%25%20to%206%25%20annualized%20returns%20in%20price%20appreciation%20over%20the%20next%20five%20years%2C%20Pimco%20data%20shows.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIn%20today's%20investing%20regime%2C%20we%20see%20a%20strong%20case%20for%20boosting%20bond%20allocations%20and%20restoring%20more%20balance%20to%20portfolios%20that%20are%20heavily%20exposed%20to%20equity%20markets%20%E2%80%94%20and%20equity%20risks%2C%26quot%3B%20Karoui%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKaroui%20pointed%20out%20that%20one-year%20forward%20S%26amp%3BP%20500%20earnings%20yields%20are%20hovering%20around%20the%20same%20level%20as%20yields%20on%20the%20Bloomberg%20US%20Aggregate%20Bond%20Index%2C%20and%20have%20been%20for%20the%20last%20few%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221806%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22equity%20earnings%20yield%20vs%20bond%20yields%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa185a4ec15fe2d3cf15390%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221140%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EPIMCO%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EGenerally%2C%20investors%20are%20compensated%20more%20for%20owning%20stocks%2C%20which%20are%20higher%20risk%20than%20much%20of%20the%20fixed-income%20universe%2C%20but%20the%20paradigm%20has%20shifted%2C%20and%20the%20return%20profile%20of%20bonds%20is%20looking%20nearly%20as%20good%2C%20especially%20given%20the%20lower%20risk.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBond%20yields%20have%20reset%20to%20higher%20levels%2C%20offering%20more%20visible%20return%20potential%2C%20while%20the%20premium%20for%20taking%20incremental%20equity%20risk%20now%20looks%20unusually%20thin.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20light%20of%20the%20recent%20bond%20sell-off%2C%20along%20with%20historically%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-bubble-sp500-valuations-tech-dot-com-seth-bernstein-ceo-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehigh%20valuations%20in%20the%20stock%20market%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20threaten%20to%20dampen%20long-term%20returns%2C%20bonds%20are%20again%20a%20compelling%20buy%2C%20Karoui%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYet%20many%20investors%20are%20still%20underweight%20bonds%2C%20as%20it's%20been%20a%20drag%20on%20portfolio%20values%20over%20recent%20years.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BFor%20much%20of%20the%20past%2016%20years%2C%20investors%20who%20chose%20bonds%20over%20stocks%20felt%20punished%2C%20especially%20given%20the%20cumulative%20returns%20in%20the%20buoyant%20stock%20market%2C%26quot%3B%20Karoui%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMany%20investors%20who%20endured%20those%20losses%20years%20ago%20haven't%20returned%20to%20bonds%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20continued.%20%26quot%3BThat%20experience%20still%20shapes%20the%20relative%20allocation%20of%20multi-asset%20portfolios%20today.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECase%20in%20point%2C%20US%20households%20have%20around%2032%25%20of%20their%20assets%20in%20stocks%2C%20a%20record%20high%2C%20he%20said.%20Meanwhile%2C%20just%204%25%20of%20their%20portfolios%20are%20in%20fixed%20income.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20that%20resembles%20your%20portfolio%2C%20Pimco%20has%20a%20message%20for%20you%3A%20bonds%20are%20back%2C%20and%20are%20no%20longer%20the%20portfolio%20dead%20weight%20they've%20been%20over%20the%20last%20decade%20and%20a%20half.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fshould-i-buy-bonds-fixed-income-treasury-yields-allocation-pimco-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788978735000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa18879ec15fe2d3cf153b8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fshould-i-buy-bonds-fixed-income-treasury-yields-allocation-pimco-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Bonds%20have%20been%20a%20drag%20on%20portfolios%20as%20their%20prices%20have%20slid%20in%20a%20rising%20rate%20environment%2C%20but%20yields%20are%20looking%20attractive%20again%2C%20Pimco%20says.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22wedwards%40businessinsider.com%20(William%20Edwards)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22The%20foldable%20iPhone%20Duo%20is%20Apple's%20boldest%20smartphone%20experiment%20yet%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222740%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20Apple%20iPhone%20Duo%20foldable%20display%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa19e049b8974787b1ca1cf%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221546%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple's%20foldable%20phone%2C%20the%20iPhone%20Duo.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EApple%20debuted%20the%20Duo%2C%20its%20first-ever%20foldable%20iPhone.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20phone%20has%20two%20displays%20and%20is%2050%25%20larger%20than%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20Max.%20It's%20priced%20at%20%241%2C999.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20foldable%20is%20one%20of%20Apple's%20first%20departures%20from%20the%20traditional%20iPhone%20form.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20its%202007%20launch%2C%20the%20iPhone%20has%20had%20the%20same%20basic%20design%3A%20a%20flat%2C%20rigid%20rectangle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENow%2C%20Apple%20is%20folding%20on%20that%20form%20factor.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20debuted%20the%20new%20foldable%20iPhone%20Duo%20on%20Tuesday%20at%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-ultra-event-today-live-updates-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eannual%20September%20hardware%20event%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20marking%20the%20biggest%20design%20change%20in%20the%20device's%20history.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeet-apple-ceo-john-ternus-replacing-tim-cook-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EJohn%20Ternus%2C%20Apple's%20CEO%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20critiqued%20other%20foldables%20that%20%26quot%3Bfeel%20like%20two%20phones%20awkwardly%20stuck%20together.%26quot%3B%20The%20company%20wanted%20a%20larger%20display%2C%20one%20that%20is%20%26quot%3Bas%20natural%20and%20intuitive%20as%20an%20iPad%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221750%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20iPhone%20Duo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1a2decc23a829a3b8f7c3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221050%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20iPhone%20Duo%20comes%20in%20two%20colors.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20device%20has%20two%20displays%3A%20the%20closed%20front%20and%20the%20full-sized%20open%20screen.%20When%20opened%2C%20the%20phone%20can%20also%20have%20two%20displays%20on%20each%20side%20of%20the%20hinge.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%2050%25%20larger%20than%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20Max%20and%2080%25%20larger%20than%20the%2018%20Pro.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20said%20it%20has%20set%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-18-pro-price-increase-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EiPhone%20Duo%20price%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20%241%2C999%20for%20256%20gigabytes%20of%20storage.%20Prices%20go%20up%20to%20%243%2C199%20for%20two%20terabytes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228417da1e-9bce-4d53-b4d2-78416d08423d%5C%22%3EBreaking%20the%20iPhone's%20design%20rut%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20certainly%20isn't%20the%20first%20company%20to%20put%20out%20a%20foldable.%20Samsung%20continues%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsamsung-unpacked-2025-galaxy-z-fold7-flip7-watch8-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eexpand%20its%20lineup%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20while%20Chinese%20companies%20like%20Honor%20and%20Oppo%20offer%20cheaper%20(and%20thinner)%20alternatives.%20One%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhuawei-mate-xt-resale-prices-skyrocket-apple-2024-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EHuawei's%20phones%3C%2Fa%3E%20folds%20not%20once%2C%20but%20twice.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20the%20move%20is%20seismic%20for%20Apple%2C%20which%20largely%20iterated%20and%20finessed%20the%20form%20factor%20Steve%20Jobs%20first%20unveiled%20in%202007.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222406%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Watching%20media%20on%20the%20iPhone%20Duo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1a0069b8974787b1ca206%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221372%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWatching%20a%20show%20on%20the%20Apple%20iPhone%20Duo%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EDesigner%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fveteran-apple-industrial-designer-christopher-stringer-has-left-2017-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EChristopher%20Stringer%3C%2Fa%3E%20recounted%20the%20process%20of%20picking%20a%20shape%20during%20Apple's%202012%20lawsuit%20against%20Samsung.%20The%20company%20tested%20an%20%26quot%3Bextrudo%26quot%3B%20model%2C%20which%20had%20a%20lozenge-like%20shape%2C%20he%20said.%20Then%2C%20it%20landed%20on%20the%20iPhone%20design%20we%20know%20and%20love.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20end%20of%20the%202012%20trial%2C%20Apple%20explicitly%20received%20its%20design%20patent%3A%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-ipad-design-patent-2012-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Erectangle%20with%20rounded%20corners%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20years%20after%2C%20Apple%20tinkered%20with%20elements%20of%20the%20design.%20It%20extended%20the%20display%20and%20removed%20the%20home%20button.%20It%20tried%20out%20new%20colors%20and%20side%20buttons.%20It%20tried%20lighter%20and%20thinner%20models.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThroughout%20it%20all%2C%20the%20basic%20rectangle%20design%20stayed%20flat.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20new%20foldable%20doesn't%20stray%20too%20far%20from%20Apple's%20roots.%20It%20does%20open%20into%20a%20rectangle%20with%20rounded%20corners%2C%20after%20all.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20the%20design%20brings%20something%20new%20to%20the%20market%20%E2%80%94%20and%20shows%20Apple%20can%20still%20mix%20it%20up.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-duo-foldable-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788978702000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa19e049b8974787b1ca1cf%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-duo-foldable-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Apple%20has%20stuck%20to%20the%20long%2C%20rectangular%20iPhone%20shape%20since%202007.%20The%20new%20iPhone%20Duo%20foldable%20shows%20Apple%20is%20still%20willing%20to%20experiment.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22hchandonnet%40businessinsider.com%20(Henry%20Chandonnet)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Apple%20raises%20iPhone%20prices%20as%20memory%20shortage%20drives%20costs%20up%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221468%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20new%20Apple%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa195eccc23a829a3b8f62c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22822%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20new%20Apple%20iPhone%2018%20Pro.%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EApple%20unveiled%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20and%20Pro%20Max.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20phones%20will%20cost%20%24100%20more%20than%20the%20previous%20iPhone%2017%20Pro%20models.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ETech%20companies%20have%20repeatedly%20cited%20the%20global%20memory%20shortage%20as%20a%20reason%20for%20hiking%20prices.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EYour%20next%20iPhone%20is%20going%20to%20cost%20you.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Tuesday%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-ultra-event-today-live-updates-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20announced%3C%2Fa%3E%20the%20new%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20and%20Pro%20Max%20%E2%80%94%20with%20price%20tags%20%24100%20higher%20than%20the%20previous%20Pro%20models.%20It%20also%20announced%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-duo-foldable-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Enew%20foldable%20iPhone%20Duo%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20priced%20at%20%241%2C999.%20Apple%20has%20yet%20to%20announce%20the%20entry-level%20iPhone%2018.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20higher%20prices%20illustrate%20how%20the%20global%20memory%20shortage%20has%20stretched%20a%20company%20as%20dominant%20as%20Apple.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20his%20final%20earnings%20call%20as%20CEO%2C%20Tim%20Cook%20said%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-price-increases-mac-ipad-memory-chip-tim-cook-iphone-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20had%20%26quot%3Breluctantly%20raised%20prices%26quot%3B%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20iPads%20and%20MacBooks%20due%20to%20the%20memory%20shortage.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20did%20it%20because%20we're%20in%20what%20I%20would%20characterize%20as%20a%20100-year%20flood%20on%20the%20memory%20pricing%20with%20exponential%20increases%20in%20memory%20prices%2C%26quot%3B%20Cook%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-ai-data-centers-are-making-everything-more-expensive-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ememory%20shortage%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20largely%20driven%20by%20the%20AI%20revolution%20as%20chipmakers%20shift%20production%20away%20from%20chips%20designed%20for%20consumer%20products%20to%20the%20more%20specialized%20chips%20required%20for%20the%20data%20centers%20that%20power%20AI%20models.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20June%2C%20Apple%20increased%20the%20prices%20of%20iPads%20by%20up%20to%2025%25%20and%20Mac%20computers%20by%20as%20much%20as%2020%25.%20At%20the%20time%2C%20the%20cost%20of%20existing%20iPhone%20models%20remained%20unchanged.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20companies%2C%20including%20some%20of%20Apple's%20competitors%2C%20have%20also%20hiked%20device%20prices.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOfficials%20at%20Samsung%20and%20Google%20have%20said%20they%20raised%20prices%20on%20some%20of%20their%20smartphone%20models%20in%20part%20due%20to%20rising%20memory%20costs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere's%20never%20been%20an%20increase%20in%20memory%20prices%20like%20the%20world's%20going%20through%20right%20now%2C%26quot%3B%20Google's%20vice%20president%20of%20devices%20and%20services%2C%20Shakil%20Barkat%2C%20said%20in%20July%20ahead%20of%20the%20release%20of%20the%20Pixel%2011.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUltimately%2C%20Google%20tacked%20%24100%20onto%20the%20Pixel%2011%2C%20though%20it%20also%20doubled%20the%20storage%20of%20the%20baseline%20edition%20as%20Google%20discontinued%20the%20128GB%20model.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20is%20a%20developing%20story%E2%80%A6%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-18-pro-price-increase-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788978581000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa19e1f9b8974787b1ca1d3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-18-pro-price-increase-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Apple%20unveiled%20the%20iPhone%2018%20Pro%20and%20Pro%20Max%20at%20its%20launch%20event.%20Prices%20start%20at%20%24100%20more%20than%20the%20previous%20models.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22bgriffiths%40insider.com%20(Brent%20D.%20Griffiths)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Trump%20gave%20%2445%2C000%20cash%20gifts%20to%20Natalie%20Harp%20and%20two%20other%20aides%2C%20public%20records%20show%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788978455000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fichef.bbci.co.uk%2Face%2Fbranded_news%2F1200%2Fcpsprodpb%2Ff663%2Flive%2Fccb59450-ac71-11f1-80f0-9795d1a5edbc.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.co.uk%2Fnews%2Farticles%2Fc046rxw93xlo%231%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20White%20House%20has%20described%20the%20cash%20gifts%20to%20Harp%20and%20three%20others%20as%20personal%20-%20and%20legal.%22%2C%22au