20G20%20Financial%20meetings%20in%20Asheville%2C%20North%20Carolina%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa18fdc9b8974787b1ca037%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225504%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EMelissa%20Sue%20Gerrits%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ELong-dated%20bond%20yields%20spiked%20after%20Scott%20Bessent%20solidified%20details%20around%20a%20buyback%20program%20on%20Wednesday.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%2010-year%20Treasury%20yield%20hit%20its%20highest%20level%20since%202023.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20move%20runs%20counter%20to%20the%20Treasury's%20aim%2C%20which%20is%20to%20lower%20borrowing%20costs.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EBond%20yields%20aren't%20playing%20ball%20with%20the%20Treasury's%20announcement%20that%20it%20will%20triple%20the%20size%20of%20its%20buybacks%20of%20long-dated%20US%20government%20debt.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETreasury%20Secretary%20Scott%20Bessent%20said%20Wednesday%20morning%20that%20the%20department%20will%20buy%20%246%20billion%20of%2010-%20and%2020-year%20bonds%20on%20Thursday.%20The%20move%2C%20first%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-yields-interest-rates-wall-street-scott-bessent-stanley-druckenmiller-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eannounced%20at%20the%20end%20of%20August%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20has%20been%20interpreted%20by%20markets%20as%20an%20attempt%20to%20rein%20in%20bond%20yields%20that%20have%20surged%20to%20the%20highest%20levels%20in%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20details%20of%20the%20plan%20stoked%20the%20opposite%20reaction.%20The%2010-year%20Treasury%20yield%20climbed%20to%204.85%25%2C%20the%20highest%20level%20since%202023.%20The%2020-year%20and%20the%2030year%20bond%20yields%20both%20rose%20to%20about%205.29%25.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdatawrapper.dwcdn.net%2F95H3e%2Fembed.js%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%20class%3D%5C%22feedlyNoScript%5C%22%3E%3Cimg%20alt%3D%5C%22Line%20chart%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdatawrapper.dwcdn.net%2F95H3e%2Ffull.png%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20read%20from%20markets%20after%20the%20announcement%20is%20that%20the%20size%20of%20the%20program%20was%20a%20disappointment%2C%20especially%20in%20the%20face%20of%20rising%20headwinds%20in%20the%20bond%20market%20that%20have%20been%20pushing%20yields%20higher%20all%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20bond%20market%20is%20quite%20literally%20fighting%20the%20US%20Treasury%20as%20the%20Iran%20War%20continues%2C%20with%20the%2010Y%20Note%20Yield%20nearing%20a%20%2B100%20basis%20point%20move%20since%20the%20war%20began%2C%26quot%3B%20a%20note%20posted%20by%20The%20Kobeissi%20Letter%20on%20X%20stated%20after%20the%20announcement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20added%3A%20%26quot%3BWithout%20an%20end%20to%20the%20Iran%20War%2C%20we%20are%20on%20track%20to%20see%20the%2010Y%20Note%20Yield%20above%205.00%25%20by%20next%20week.%20American%20consumers%2C%20homebuyers%2C%20and%20borrowers%20are%20in%20for%20a%20rude%20awakening.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20forces%20pushing%20up%20yields%20are%20largely%20beyond%20the%20Treasury's%20control.%20The%20week%20began%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbusinessinsider.com%2Foil-prices-today-100-barrel-gas-prices-iran-war-attacks-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ea%20fresh%20spike%20in%20oil%20prices%3C%2Fa%3E%20caused%20by%20renewed%20fighting%20between%20the%20US%20and%20Iran%2C%20which%20was%20followed%20immediately%20by%20a%20jump%20in%20yields%20on%20Tuesday%20as%20investors%20worried%20about%20more%20inflation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMeanwhile%2C%20last%20week's%20hot%20jobs%20report%20lifted%20rate-hike%20odds%2C%20with%20markets%20seeing%20next%20week's%20meeting%20as%20likely%20to%20deliver%20a%20hawkish%20result%20and%20defy%20Donald%20Trump's%20renewed%20calls%20for%20the%20Fed%20and%20Kevin%20Warsh%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbusinessinsider.com%2Ftrump-fed-interest-rates-cuts-august-jobs-report-kevin-warsh-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Elower%20interest%20rates%3C%2Fa%3E%20after%20the%20strong%20jobs%20data.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BToday%20is%20a%20bad%20day%20for%20global%20bond%20markets.%20The%20problem%20with%20trying%20to%20artificially%20cap%20long-term%20yields%20-%20as%20with%20Treasury%20buybacks%20-%20is%20that%20yields%20jump%20if%20markets%20think%20buybacks%20are%20too%20small.%20This%20tells%20you%20underlying%20upward%20pressure%20is%20intense%2C%26quot%3B%20Brookings%20Institution%20fellow%20Robin%20Brooks%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMeanwhile%2C%20high%20yields%20are%20also%20becoming%20an%20issue%20for%20stock%20investors.%20Stocks%20on%20Wednesday%20slid%20for%20a%20second%20day%20in%20the%20holiday-shortened%20trading%20week%20as%20yields%20spiked.%20Pimco%2C%20the%20%242.3%20trillion%20fixed-income%20investment%20shop%2C%20said%20in%20a%20note%20this%20week%20that%20rising%20yields%20offer%20a%20compelling%20alternative%20for%20investors%20for%20the%20first%20time%20in%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBond%20yields%20have%20reset%20to%20higher%20levels%2C%20offering%20more%20visible%20return%20potential%2C%20while%20the%20premium%20for%20taking%20incremental%20equity%20risk%20now%20looks%20unusually%20thin%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20firm%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-yields-surging-treasury-6-billion-buyback-scott-bessent-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788975640000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa199f09b8974787b1ca145%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-yields-surging-treasury-6-billion-buyback-scott-bessent-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20move%20higher%20in%20yields%20on%20Wednesday%2