eristics%20are%20uncommon%20in%20American%20subway%20systems%20and%20can%20be%20confusing.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EFrom%20unwritten%20etiquette%20rules%20to%20fare%20must-knows%2C%20here%20are%20some%20surprising%20things%20about%20the%20Tube.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20it's%20ridiculously%20busy%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisappointing-photos-show-traveling-london-underground-really-like-2020-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Erush%20hour%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20way%20too%20hot%20in%20the%20summer%2C%20the%20Tube%20is%20an%20essential%20part%20of%20life%20in%20London.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20a%20local%2C%20I%20sometimes%20use%20the%20public%20transit%20system%20%E2%80%94%20formally%20called%20the%20London%20Underground%20%E2%80%94more%20than%20four%20or%20five%20times%20on%20some%20days%2C%20as%20it's%20often%20the%20quickest%20way%20to%20get%20around%20the%20city.%20I%20can%20thank%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisappointing-photos-show-traveling-london-underground-really-like-2020-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ELondon%20Tube%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20saving%20me%20from%20missed%20flights%20or%20arriving%20late%20for%20an%20interview.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENonetheless%2C%20I%20can't%20count%20how%20many%20times%20I've%20seen%20tourists%20staring%20at%20a%20Tube%20map%2C%20trying%20to%20make%20sense%20of%20its%20seemingly%20endless%20tangle%20of%20colored%20lines.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20as%20someone%20who%20uses%20the%20Tube%20all%20the%20time%2C%20I%20have%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcitymapper-transport-app-smashes-crowdfunding-target-in-one-day-2021-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECitymapper%20app%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20the%20ready%20when%20taking%20an%20unfamiliar%20route.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Tube%20also%20has%20some%20rules%20%E2%80%94%20both%20official%20and%20unwritten%20%E2%80%94%20that%20I%20would%20consider%20necessary%20for%20any%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-never-do-london-travel-mistakes-from-local-uk-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etourist%20coming%20to%20London%3C%2Fa%3E.%20If%20you%20have%20seen%20what%20happens%20when%20someone%20stands%20on%20the%20left-hand%20side%20of%20the%20escalator%2C%20you%20will%20know%20what%20I%20mean.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%2010%20surprising%20things%20you%20probably%20don't%20know%20about%20the%20Tube%2C%20including%20some%20that%20might%20be%20useful%20to%20know%20as%20a%20tourist.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E1.%20Most%20Tube%20trains%20have%20no%20air%20conditioning%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222800%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Person%20in%20a%20red%20dress%20stands%20on%20an%20Underground%20platform%20beside%20a%20red%20train%20with%20passengers%20reflected%20in%20the%20windows.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a90677c3f7df8787cff44ec%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221864%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20commuter%20holds%20a%20portable%20handheld%20electric%20fan%20during%20the%202025%20heatwave.%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOnly%20about%2031%25%20of%20trains%20on%20the%20Tube%20network%20have%20passenger%20air%20conditioning%2C%20according%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftfl.gov.uk%2Fcorporate%2Ftransparency%2Ffreedom-of-information%2Ffoi-request-detail%3FreferenceId%3DFOI-1582-2526%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETransport%20for%20London%3C%2Fa%3E%20(TFL).%20As%20soon%20as%20a%20heat%20wave%20hits%2C%20I%20cannot%20ride%20the%20Tube%20without%20carrying%20blotting%20paper%20and%20a%20handheld%20fan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20lines%20are%20notorious%20for%20how%20hot%20they%20get.%20Having%20to%20take%20the%20Central%20Line%20in%20the%20summer%20will%20elicit%20sympathy%20from%20any%20Londoner.%20The%20London%20Standard%20reported%20that%20it%20reached%20almost%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.standard.co.uk%2Fnews%2Flondon%2Fhottest-tube-lines-central-line-temperatures-london-underground-tfl-b1287448.html%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E103%20degrees%3C%2Fa%3E%20during%20the%20recent%20June%20heat%20wave.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20that%20in%20mind%2C%20you%20may%20also%20be%20surprised%20to%20learn%20that%20in%201926%2C%20the%20London%20Underground%20was%20advertised%20as%20%26quot%3Bcooler%20below%26quot%3B%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ltmuseum.co.uk%2Fcollections%2Fcollections-online%2Fposters%2Fitem%2F1983-4-2030%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eon%3C%2Fa%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ltmuseum.co.uk%2Fcollections%2Fcollections-online%2Fposters%2Fitem%2F1983-4-2030%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%20a%20hot%20day%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E2.%20The%20seats%20are%20covered%20in%20fabric%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224461%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Empty%20blue%20patterned%20bench%20seats%20line%20the%20interior%20of%20a%20public%20transit%20train%20carriage.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9ea15b4f6138b37ff333b3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223346%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThis%20is%20the%20most%20common%20moquette%20on%20the%20Tube%2C%20known%20as%20the%20Barman%20moquette.%3Cp%3EGareth%20Fuller%2FPA%20Images%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EUnlike%20the%20hard%20plastic%20seats%20in%20most%20American%20public%20transport%2C%20Tube%20seats%20are%20covered%20in%20a%20woolen%20fabric%20called%20moquette.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20been%20used%20on%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ltmuseum.co.uk%2Fcollections%2Fstories%2Fdesign%2Fhistory-moquette%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETube%20since%201920%3C%2Fa%3E%20because%20it%20hides%20wear%20and%20tear%20and%20dirt%2C%20and%20also%20because%20it's%20durable.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAdmittedly%2C%20it%20does%20gross%20me%20out%20a%20bit%2C%20even%20though%20it%20gets%20cleaned.%20But%20it's%20definitely%20more%20comfortable%20than%20plastic%2C%20at%20least.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E3.%20The%20price%20of%20your%20journey%20depends%20on%20how%20many%20zones%20you%20travel%20through%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221388%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22London%20public%20transport%20fare%20poster%20shows%20Oyster%20pay%20as%20you%20go%20costs%2C%20ticket%20caps%2C%20and%20Travelcard%20zone%20prices.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9ea14b4f6138b37ff333b2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221041%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EASphotowed%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20the%20New%20York%20City%20subway%20has%20a%20flat%20fare%2C%20the%20cost%20of%20a%20journey%20on%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftfl.gov.uk%2Ffares%2Ffind-fares%2Ftube-and-rail-fares%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ETube%20varies%3C%2Fa%3E%20depending%20on%20how%20far%20you%20travel.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELondon's%20transport%20network%20is%20split%20into%20fare%20zones%2C%20from%20the%20most%20central%20to%20the%20farthest%20out%3A%20Zones%201%20to%209.%20People%20here%20often%20joke%20that%20the%20zone%20you%20live%20in%20also%20determines%20how%20much%20of%20a%20%26quot%3Btrue%26quot%3B%20Londoner%20you%20are.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20example%2C%20a%20single%20journey%20within%20Zone%201%20will%20cost%20you%20%C2%A33%20at%20off-peak%20hours%2C%20and%20%C2%A33.10%20at%20peak%20hours.%20However%2C%20if%20you%20travel%20from%20Zone%206%20to%201%2C%20or%20vice%20versa%2C%20it%20will%20cost%20you%20between%20%C2%A34%20and%20%C2%A35.90.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E4.%20Traveling%20at%20rush%20hour%20will%20usually%20cost%20you%20more%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224608%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Crowded%20public%20transit%20car%20seen%20through%20a%20window%2C%20with%20passengers%20standing%2C%20seated%2C%20holding%20rails%2C%20and%20using%20smartphones.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9ea28461854fb4851a47c1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223456%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20Tube%20during%20rush%20hour.%3Cp%3EToby%20Shepheard%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ERush%20hour%20is%20known%20as%20peak%20time%20on%20the%20Underground%20and%20other%20rail%20services.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPeak%20time%20is%20Monday%20to%20Friday%2C%20except%20public%20holidays%2C%20between%206%3A30%20a.m.%20and%209%3A30%20a.m.%2C%20and%20between%204%20p.m.%20and%207%20p.m.%20Fares%20are%20higher%20at%20these%20times.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20addition%20to%20saving%20a%20bit%20of%20money%2C%20I%20would%20recommend%20avoiding%20these%20times%20for%20travel.%20Carriages%20can%20get%20crammed%2C%20and%20people%20can%20be%20unforgiving%20if%20you're%20carrying%20a%20large%20suitcase%20or%20walking%20too%20slowly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E5.%20You%20have%20to%20tap%20both%20in%20and%20out%20of%20the%20Tube%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221414%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Contactless%20transit%20card%20reader%20and%20black%20ticket%20barriers%20stand%20at%20a%20rail%20station%20entrance.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9ea3284f6138b37ff333bc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221061%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMost%20Tube%20stations%20have%20barriers%20like%20these%20to%20tap%20in%20and%20out%20of.%3Cp%3EMariano%20Garcia%20Gaspar%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20all%20these%20varying%20fare%20prices%2C%20you%20have%20to%20tap%20your%20card%2C%20contactless%2C%20Oyster%2C%20or%20physical%20ticket%20in%20and%20out%20of%20the%20Tube.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOften%2C%20there%20are%20barriers%20upon%20both%20entry%20and%20exit%2C%20so%20you%20wouldn't%20miss%20this%2C%20but%20sometimes%20there%20aren't.%20In%20these%20stations%2C%20you%20have%20to%20look%20for%20a%20yellow%20card%20reader%20to%20tap%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20don't%20tap%20out%2C%20you%20will%20be%20charged%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftfl.gov.uk%2Ffares%2Ftouching-in-and-out%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emaximum%20fare%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20that%20line.%20I've%20had%20this%20happen%20to%20me%20before%2C%20but%20luckily%2C%20you%20can%20request%20a%20refund%20from%20TFL%20if%20it%20happens%20again.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E6.%20Many%20of%20the%20carriages%20have%20armrests%20between%20passengers%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221007%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Empty%20underground%20train%20carriage%20with%20blue%20seats%2C%20blue%20poles%2C%20route%20maps%2C%20and%20advertising%20panels%20inside.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9ea42cf320febc610d50ee%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22755%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EClaudiac8%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20like%20your%20personal%20space%2C%20you%20might%20be%20pleased%20to%20know%20that%20most%20Tube%20carriages%20have%20an%20armrest%20between%20seats.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20despite%20their%20name%2C%20I%20see%20them%20as%20more%20of%20a%20separation%20barrier%20than%20an%20actual%20armrest.%20Resting%20your%20arms%20on%20these%20is%20a%20faux%20pas%20(unless%20you%20absolutely%20have%20to)%20if%20there%20are%20people%20sitting%20on%20either%20side%20of%20you.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E7.%20More%20than%20half%20of%20the%20London%20Underground%20is%20actually%20above%20ground%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223905%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Paddington%20Underground%20Station%20concourse%20with%20ticket%20barriers%2C%20wayfinding%20signs%2C%20and%20face%20covering%20notices%20visible.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9152b379f11f0a89f91eb3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222642%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPaddington%20underground%20station%20is%20above%20ground.%3Cp%3EPete%20Clifton%2FPA%20Images%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20you%20may%20be%20expecting%20to%20descend%20deep%20underground%20when%20taking%20the%20Tube%2C%20this%20isn't%20always%20the%20case.%20Despite%20its%20name%2C%20most%20of%20the%20London%20Underground's%20stations%20are%20above%20ground.%20I%20find%20this%20is%20handy%20for%20getting%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Waterloo%20%26amp%3B%20City%20and%20Victoria%20lines%20are%20the%20only%20two%20fully%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftfl.gov.uk%2Fcorporate%2Ftransparency%2Ffreedom-of-information%2Ffoi-request-detail%3FreferenceId%3DFOI-0525-2324%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eunderground%20tube%20lines%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E8.%20You%20should%20always%20stand%20on%20the%20right-hand%20side%20of%20the%20escalator%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Commuters%20ride%20long%20escalators%20through%20a%20curved%20underground%20transit%20station%20tunnel%20with%20metallic%20walls.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a906c7279f11f0a89f91a9b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222668%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPassengers%20use%20an%20escalator%20at%20London%20Bridge%20Underground%20station.%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20ultimate%20word%20of%20advice%20for%20anyone%20coming%20to%20London%20is%20to%20never%20stand%20on%20the%20left-hand%20side%20of%20the%20escalator.%20The%20left%20side%20is%20for%20people%20walking%20up%20or%20down%20in%20a%20hurry.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20an%20efficient%20system%20that%20has%20saved%20me%20from%20being%20late%20hundreds%20of%20times.%20You%20will%20be%20asked%20to%20move%20aside%20if%20you%20break%20this%20rule.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E9.%20You%20can%20visit%20the%20disused%20tunnels%20and%20abandoned%20tracks%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225333%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20disused%20passageway%20during%20a%20tour%20at%20the%20Piccadilly%20Circus%20disused%20tube%20station%20in%20London.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a905c673f7df8787cff4465%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20disused%20passageway%20during%20a%20tour%20at%20the%20Piccadilly%20Circus%20disused%20tube%20station.%3Cp%3EKirsty%20O'Connor%2FPA%20Images%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20you%20like%20all%20things%20spooky%20and%20historical%2C%20I%20recommend%20checking%20out%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ltmuseum.co.uk%2Fhidden-london%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ELondon%20Transport%20Museum%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20offers%20tours%20of%20disused%20Tube%20stations%2C%20passenger%20corridors%2C%20and%20tunnels.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fphotos-maze-hidden-tunnels-historic-london-tube-station-2023-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethese%20spaces%3C%2Fa%3E%20have%20been%20used%20as%20sets%20for%20TV%20shows%20and%20films%2C%20including%20Skyfall%20and%20Sherlock.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E10.%20There%20aren't%20actually%20as%20many%2024-hour%20services%20in%20London%20as%20you%20might%20think%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Passengers%20sit%20and%20stand%20inside%20a%20crowded%20metro%20train%20carriage%20with%20blue%20poles%20and%20patterned%20seats.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a90700b79f11f0a89f91add%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPassengers%20sit%20on%20the%20ground%20on%20board%20the%20Night%20Tube%20on%20the%20night%20of%20its%20launch.%3Cp%3EJack%20Taylor%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ELondon%20is%20not%20quite%20the%20city%20that%20never%20sleeps.%20I%20have%20rarely%20taken%20the%20Tube%20past%20midnight%20and%20instead%20rely%20on%20Ubers%20and%20night%20buses%20to%20get%20me%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOnly%20five%20Tube%20lines%20run%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftfl.gov.uk%2Fmodes%2Ftube%2Fnight-tube%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E24-hour%20services%3C%2Fa%3E%3A%20Central%2C%20Jubilee%2C%20Northern%20(Charing%20Cross%20branch)%2C%20Piccadilly%2C%20and%20Victoria.%20The%20Windrush%20line%2C%20which%20is%20part%20of%20the%20London%20Overground%2C%20also%20has%20a%20night%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Night%20Tube%20is%20also%20only%20open%20on%20Fridays%20and%20Saturdays.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsurprise-facts-london-underground-tube-americans-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788974036000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a9ee792f320febc610d51f8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsurprise-facts-london-underground-tube-americans-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22I%20sometimes%20ride%20the%20London%20Underground%20four%20or%20five%20times%20a%20day.%20Most%20of%20the%20Tube%20is%20normal%20to%20me%2C%20but%20there%20are%20some%20unwritten%20etiquette%20rules.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22rshahidi%40businessinsider.com%20(Roya%20Shahidi)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Reliance%20on%20common%20tech%20providers%20raises%20contagion%20risk%3A%20RBI%20deputy%20guv%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788973657000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fbsmedia.business-standard.com%2F_media%2Fbs%2Fimg%2Farticle%2F2026-07%2F28%2Fthumb%2Ffitandfill%2F1200X628%2F1785177312-0239.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Findia-news%2Fcommon-tech-dependencies-could-amplify-financial-system-risks-rbi-dg-126090901399_1.html%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22RBI%20Deputy%20Governor%20Rohit%20Ja