es%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EAccenture%20has%20formed%20a%20new%20business%20group%2C%20supported%20by%20Google%20Cloud%2C%20to%20help%20companies%20deploy%20AI%20agents.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20group%20includes%201000%20forward-deployed%20engineers%20ready%20to%20embed%20with%20clients.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EConsulting%20firms%20have%20become%20crucial%20intermediaries%20between%20AI%20companies%20and%20large%20companies.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faccenture-ceo-ai-use-is-required-for-promotion-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAccenture%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20sending%20an%20army%20of%20engineers%20onto%20the%20AI%20battlefield.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20consulting%20giant%20and%20Google%20Cloud%20are%20teaming%20up%20to%20send%201%2C000%20engineers%20to%20work%20with%20major%20clients%20on%20deploying%20AI%20agents%2C%20in%20a%20partnership%20they're%20calling%20the%20Accenture%20Gemini%20Enterprise%20Business%20Group.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20brings%20together%20Accenture's%20Google%20Cloud-skilled%20professionals%20and%20engineers%20with%20Accenture%20consultants%20with%20industry%20expertise.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20key%20part%20of%20the%20group's%20offering%20is%20the%20promise%20of%201%2C000%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhottest-job-ai-forward-deployed-engineer-skills-need-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eforward-deployed%20engineers%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Accenture%20professionals%20who%20are%20experts%20in%20the%20Gemini%20AI%20platform.%20They%20will%20embed%20with%20clients%20to%20help%20them%20roll%20out%20AI%20across%20their%20businesses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EForward-deployed%20engineers%20work%20inside%20companies%20to%20integrate%20AI%20into%20workflows%20and%20customize%20AI%20tools%20for%20each%20specific%20client%20to%20make%20their%20work%20easier%20or%20more%20efficient.%20The%20role%20was%20popularized%20by%20Palantir%20and%20is%20now%20one%20of%20the%20buzziest%20jobs%20in%20tech%20%E2%80%94%20postings%20for%20the%20position%20have%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fforward-deployed-engineer-jobs-in-demand-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Egrown%20more%20than%20700%25%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%20last%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20press%20release%2C%20Accenture%20CEO%20Julie%20Sweet%20said%20the%20group's%20combined%20technical%20and%20industry%20expertise%20will%20help%20clients%20deploy%20AI%20agents%20and%20realize%20value%20from%20them%20more%20quickly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225088%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Accenture%20CEO%20Julie%20Sweet%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa17868ec15fe2d3cf15274%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223392%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EJulie%20Sweet%2C%20Accenture's%20CEO%20and%20chair.%3Cp%3ERonny%20HARTMANN%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20investment%20also%20includes%20plans%20to%20expand%20Gemini%20Enterprise%20training%20for%2050%2C000%20Accenture%20employees.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20new%20Accenture%20Gemini%20Enterprise%20Business%20Group%20will%20support%20clients%20with%20%26quot%3Ba%20dedicated%2C%20specialized%20team%26quot%3B%20to%20help%20meet%20the%20market%20demand%20for%20Gemini%20Enterprise%2C%20Chetna%20Sehgal%2C%20the%20Accenture%20Gemini%20Enterprise%20Business%20Group%20lead%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20teams%20will%20work%20together%20on%20platform%20engineering%2C%20aligned%20with%20the%20client's%20specific%20industry%2C%20process%2C%20and%20required%20changes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThat%20combination%20is%20what%20lets%20clients%20architect%2C%20build%2C%20and%20scale%20Gemini%20Enterprise%20solutions%20with%20real%20speed%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Sehgal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2249373e46-e2c9-4657-92db-c2cf52819a06%5C%22%3ETech%20and%20consulting%20are%20teaming%20up%20more%20and%20more%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EConsultancies%20like%20Accenture%20shape%20how%20companies%20spend%20money%2C%20buy%20technology%2C%20and%20redesign%20work.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20have%20become%20critical%20intermediaries%20in%20the%20AI%20boom%2C%20linking%20AI%20companies%20with%20their%20vast%20roster%20of%20Fortune%20500%20clients%2C%20who%20often%20want%20the%20familiarity%20and%20breadth%20that%20a%20traditional%20consulting%20firm%20can%20offer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20deal%20works%20both%20ways%3A%20AI%20firms%20have%20little%20time%20to%20focus%20on%20implementation%20and%20sales%2C%20so%20consultants%20step%20in%20to%20fill%20the%20gap.%20In%20return%2C%20consultancies%20attach%20themselves%20to%20top%20names%20in%20tech%20and%20get%20access%20to%20enterprise-grade%20tools%20for%20their%20own%20workforces.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20result%20has%20been%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-pwc-big-four-business-ai-adoption-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cu%3Ea%20flurry%20of%20partnerships%C2%A0%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fa%3Ebetween%20top%20consulting%20firms%20and%20AI%20leaders%20such%20as%20Anthropic%2C%20OpenAI%2C%20Nvidia%2C%20and%20Microsoft.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAccenture%20partnered%20with%20ChatGPT%20last%20December%20and%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faccenture-anthrophic-open-ai-deal-claude-consulting-2025-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%3Cu%3Eexpanded%20its%20partnership%20with%20Anthropic%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%20a%20week%20later.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%2C%20a%20digital%20and%20technology%20specialist%2C%20has%20also%20been%20remaking%20its%20own%20workforce%20for%20the%20AI%20era.%20Sweet%20has%20previously%20said%20that%20AI%20is%20Accenture's%20strongest%20bet%20for%20creating%20new%20demand%2C%20and%20in%20March%202026%2C%20said%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faccenture-ceo-ai-use-is-required-for-promotion-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Egetting%20a%20promotion%20at%20Accenture%3C%2Fa%3E%20now%20required%20AI%20use.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%202025%2C%20the%20firm%20consolidated%20several%20of%20its%20key%20divisions%20into%20a%20single%20unit%20known%20as%20%26quot%3Breinvention%20services%2C%26quot%3B%20and%20executives%20said%20it%20would%20be%20%26quot%3Bexiting%26quot%3B%20employees%20it%20can't%20retrain%20with%20artificial%20intelligence%20skills.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company's%20stock%20is%20down%2029%25%20over%20the%20last%20year%2C%20and%20in%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faccenture-stock-ceo-julie-sweet-ai-transformation%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethird-quarter%20earnings%C2%A0report%20in%20June%2C%20Accenture%20said%3C%2Fa%3E%20new%20bookings%20were%20down%202%25%20for%20the%20quarter.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESweet's%20message%20to%20the%20investors%20betting%20on%20the%20company%20was%20simple%3A%20Be%20patient.%20As%20companies%20seek%20Accenture's%20help%20to%20integrate%20AI%2C%20she%20said%2C%20the%20numbers%20will%20improve.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faccenture-google-cloud-business-group-forward-deployed-engineers-ai-agents-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788973603000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa12cce9b8974787b1c9c0e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Faccenture-google-cloud-business-group-forward-deployed-engineers-ai-agents-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Accenture%20has%20partnered%20with%20Google%20Cloud%20to%20invest%20in%20its%20technical%20consulting%20expertise%20and%20bring%20AI%20agents%20to%20clients.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22pthompson%40businessinsider.com%20(Polly%20Thompson)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A95%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22UPI%20data%20can%20help%20bring%20informal%20sector%20into%20formal%20credit%3A%20NITI's%20Lahiri%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788973391000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fbsmedia.business-standard.com%2F_media%2Fbs%2Fimg%2Farticle%2F2026-05%2F08%2Fthumb%2Ffitandfill%2F1200X628%2F1778240063-0869.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Findia-must-leverage-upi-data-to-bring-msmes-into-formal-credit-lahiri-126090901529_1.html%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22NITI%20Aayog's%20Ashok%20Lahiri%20said%20transaction%20data%20generated%20through%20UPI%20could%20improve%20credit%20appraisal%20and%20risk%20pricing%2C%20helping%20bring%20MSMEs%20into%20the%20formal%20lending%20system%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A95%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Findia-must-leverage-upi-data-to-bring-msmes-into-formal-credit-lahiri-126090901529_1.html%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-business--standard-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Findia-must-leverage-upi-data-to-bring-msmes-into-formal-credit-lahiri-126090901529_1.html%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Findia-must-leverage-upi-data-to-bring-msmes-into-formal-credit-lahiri-126090901529_1.html%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Flipkart%20tests%20'Eat%20In'%20food%20delivery%2C%20pilots%20standalone%20Minutes%20app%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1788973211000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fbsmedia.business-standard.com%2F_media%2Fbs%2Fimg%2Farticle%2F2026-01%2F17%2Fthumb%2Ffitandfill%2F1200X628%2F1768627767-0047.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Fcompanies%2Fnews%2Fflipkart-tests-eat-in-food-delivery-pilots-standalone-minutes-app-126090901696_1.html%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Flipkart%20is%20testing%20Eat%20In%20with%20employees%20and%20a%20standalone%20Minutes%20app%20with%20