%26quot%3B%20he%20said%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-agents-bot-bragging-workplace-flex-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20agents%3C%2Fa%3E%20can%20do%20lots%20of%20tasks.%20Landing%20you%20a%20table%20at%20one%20of%20New%20York's%20trendiest%20restaurants%20might%20not%20be%20one.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJC%20Bahr-de%20Stefano%2C%20principal%20at%20Better%20Tomorrow%20Ventures%2C%20a%20fintech-focused%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flawyers-back-new-vc-firm-gcvc-legal-tech-investing-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EVC%20firm%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20learned%20that%20after%20he%20connected%20an%20AI%20tool%20called%20Instinct%20to%20his%20Resy%20account%20in%20hopes%20of%20getting%20a%20reservation%20at%204%20Charles%20Prime%20Rib%2C%20the%20West%20Village%20steakhouse%20where%20diners%20gobble%20up%20reservations%20within%20seconds%20of%20them%20appearing%20online.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInstinct%2C%20which%20is%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finstinct-is-the-ai-assistant-silicon-valley-cant-stop-talking-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Einvite-only%20service%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20the%20moment%2C%20communicates%20with%20users%20via%20text.%20The%20bet%20was%20that%20Instinct%20could%20check%20for%20open%20tables%20at%204%20Charles%20much%20more%20frequently%20than%20Bahr-de%20Stefano%20%E2%80%94%20or%20any%20other%20human%20%E2%80%94%20could%20manually.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInstead%20of%20getting%20him%20a%20ticket%20to%20some%20prime%20rib%20or%20an%20egg-topped%20burger%2C%20though%2C%20Bahr-de%20Stefano's%20AI%20agent%20spammed%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fresy-sevenrooms-premium-restaurant-experiences-reserved-for-high-paying-diners-2023-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EResy's%20website%3C%2Fa%3E%20so%20much%20that%20the%20platform%20temporarily%20shut%20down%20his%20account.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20VC's%20experience%20is%20another%20example%20of%20how%20AI%20agents%20are%20bending%20or%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-agents-rogue-strategies-cheating-lying-german-wiki-openai-anthropic-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebreaking%20the%20rules%20of%20the%20internet%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20from%20impersonating%20Wikipedia%20editors%20to%20trying%20to%20convince%20a%20GitHub%20user%20to%20upload%20malware%20into%20a%20project.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAgents%20might%20appear%20to%20understand%20their%20objective%2C%20though%20exactly%20how%20they%20carry%20it%20out%20%E2%80%94%20and%20whether%20the%20strategy%20they%20pick%20might%20have%20unintended%20consequences%20%E2%80%94%20is%20often%20an%20afterthought.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BResy%20does%20not%20currently%20permit%20unapproved%20third-party%20bots%20or%20agents%20to%20independently%20access%20or%20interact%20with%20the%20Resy%20platform%2C%26quot%3B%20an%20American%20Express%20spokesperson%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20%26quot%3BUnapproved%20automated%20activity%20can%20introduce%20risks%20to%20the%20platform%20and%20compromise%20a%20fair%20reservation%20experience%20for%20diners.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUsers%20can%20find%20restaurants%20and%20make%20reservations%20through%20Resy's%20integrations%20with%20OpenAI's%20ChatGPT%20and%20Anthropic's%20Claude%2C%20the%20spokesperson%20said.%20The%20company%20declined%20to%20comment%20specifically%20on%20Bahr-de%20Stefano's%20case.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f14004d7-be74-4112-a405-1777648ae849%5C%22%3E'It%20was%20acting%20like%20a%20bot'%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EBahr-de%20Stefano%20noticed%20the%20Resy%20issue%20on%20Sunday%20when%20he%20couldn't%20get%20into%20his%20account.%20In%20his%20email%20inbox%2C%20there%20was%20a%20message%20from%20the%20American%20Express-owned%20reservation%20platform%20saying%20that%20his%20account%20had%20%26quot%3Bdisplayed%20behavior%20in%20violation%20of%20Resy's%20Terms%20of%20Service.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20got%20details%20about%20what%20went%20wrong%20after%20checking%20Instinct's%20activity%20log.%20Unbeknownst%20to%20Bahr-de%20Stefano%2C%20the%20AI%20agent%20had%20been%20sending%20Resy%20about%20200%20API%20requests%20per%20hour.%20That%20included%20checking%20the%20restaurant's%20availability%20through%20Resy%20every%2010%20minutes%20throughout%20the%20day%2C%20as%20well%20as%20looking%20every%200.4%20seconds%20around%20the%20time%20that%20reservations%20usually%20dropped%20each%20morning.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20behavior%20mimics%20the%20bots%20that%20some%20people%20use%20to%20snag%20everything%20from%20restaurant%20reservations%20to%20limited-run%20pairs%20of%20sneakers%20and%20resell%20them%2C%20Bahr-de%20Stefano%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBahr-de%20Stefano%20wrote%20back%20to%20Resy%2C%20laying%20out%20how%20he%20had%20used%20the%20AI%20agent.%20The%20log%20made%20clear%20why%20his%20account%20had%20been%20flagged%2C%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOf%20course%2C%20this%20account%20got%20flagged%20for%20spam%2C%20because%20it%20was%20acting%20like%20a%20bot%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Tuesday%2C%20an%20email%20from%20Resy%20informed%20him%20that%20the%20company%20had%20reinstated%20his%20account.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20came%20with%20a%20warning%2C%20though%3A%20If%20he%20did%20it%20again%2C%20American%20Express%20could%20permanently%20close%20his%20Resy%20account%20as%20well%20as%20his%20AmEx%20credit%20card.%20Bahr-de%20Stefano%20shared%20screenshots%20of%20the%20Resy%20and%20American%20Express%20emails%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fjbahrdestefano%2Fstatus%2F2097373015642099887%3Fs%3D20%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eposts%20on%20X%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20tool%20has%20worked%20well%20in%20other%20cases%2C%20such%20as%20finding%20an%20appointment%20at%20an%20otherwise%20booked-up%20doctor's%20office%20and%20deciding%20which%20attractions%20to%20visit%20in%20Paris%20during%20a%20trip%2C%20Bahr-de%20Stefano%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThat%20was%20part%20of%20what%20made%20it%20really%20great%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BIt%20felt%20like%20magic.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20VC%20said%20that%20he%20plans%20to%20continue%20using%20Instinct%2C%20though%20with%20some%20adjustments.%20Instead%20of%20simply%20giving%20the%20AI%20agent%20a%20simple%20prompt%2C%20he%20said%2C%20he'll%20now%20set%20parameters%20on%20how%20the%20agent%20tackles%20the%20task%2C%20such%20as%20how%20often%20it%20pings%20a%20website%20looking%20for%20reservations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20will%20probably%2C%20in%20the%20short%20term%2C%20ask%20it%20to%20lay%20out%20a%20plan%20and%20tell%20me%20what%20the%20plan%20is%20before%20it%20does%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20same%20time%2C%20he%20added%2C%20websites%20like%20Resy%20need%20to%20distinguish%20between%20legitimate%20AI%20agents%20and%20those%20with%20more%20nefarious%20intentions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMost%20of%20these%20sellers%20or%20providers%20need%20to%20get%20to%20a%20point%20where%20they%20can%20understand%20the%20difference%20between%20a%20verified%20agent%20acting%20on%20someone's%20behalf%20versus%20a%20bot%20farm%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Aabitter%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Eabitter%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20or%20via%20encrypted%20messaging%20app%20Signal%20at%20808-854-4501.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%2C%20a%20nonwork%20WiFi%20network%2C%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20here's%20our%20guide%20to%20sharing%20information%20securely.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fresy-suspends-vcs-account-ai-agent-reservation-attempt-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22p